(1794371, 245508, 41899, '<td valign="top">Looks like it is windy on the water giving it a shear look and the trees in the background are soft in contrast.  I like the color of the night sky.  The moon looks as though the camera moved a tiny bit because of the unnatural oval shape which I have done myself taking pictures of it.  I would prefer to see the edges of the trees against the sky more defined.</td>', 'Looks like it is windy on the water giving it a shear look and the trees in the background are soft in contrast.  I like the color of the night sky.  The moon looks as though the camera moved a tiny bit because of the unnatural oval shape which I have done myself taking pictures of it.  I would prefer to see the edges of the trees against the sky more defined.', '2005-10-19 01:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
