(1794584, 246256, 9906, '<td valign="top">Dude, I think I see your camera in the cars window so I gotta score ya down!  Just kidding.  You know how I feel about scoring shots that I know in a challenge.  I don''t normally vote for them.  This is another example of a shot that I have to score because it deserves it.  Don''t ask me what I gave it or I''ll have to kick your ass!  Oh and just for the record, you made my wallpaper of the day!<br/>Kudos<br/>TC<br/>PS:  If you break 7 before I do I''m gonna kick your ass for that too!</td>', 'Dude, I think I see your camera in the cars window so I gotta score ya down!  Just kidding.  You know how I feel about scoring shots that I know in a challenge.  I don''t normally vote for them.  This is another example of a shot that I have to score because it deserves it.  Don''t ask me what I gave it or I''ll have to kick your ass!  Oh and just for the record, you made my wallpaper of the day!KudosTCPS:  If you break 7 before I do I''m gonna kick your ass for that too!', '2005-10-19 03:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1794643, 243993, 46023, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the colors and how subtle this photo is!</td>', 'I LOVE the colors and how subtle this photo is!', '2005-10-19 03:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1794658, 246189, 37252, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, but the wall edge on the left is too distracting. A suggestion might be to crop the left side to just the rounded portion of the wall edge. This would give it framing, but eliminate the distracting parts.<br/>The softness is nice - a dreamy feeling.</td>', 'Interesting photo, but the wall edge on the left is too distracting. A suggestion might be to crop the left side to just the rounded portion of the wall edge. This would give it framing, but eliminate the distracting parts.The softness is nice - a dreamy feeling.', '2005-10-19 03:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1794689, 245319, 35545, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but I like the reflection.  I think you could have gotten away with cutting out the top of the picture and filling the frame with the reflection.  The middle ground between the bridge and the reflection isn''t that interesting and I think the reflection, the bricks, and the sand could carry the picture by themselves.  IMHO, you just don''t need the bridge.</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but I like the reflection.  I think you could have gotten away with cutting out the top of the picture and filling the frame with the reflection.  The middle ground between the bridge and the reflection isn''t that interesting and I think the reflection, the bricks, and the sand could carry the picture by themselves.  IMHO, you just don''t need the bridge.', '2005-10-19 03:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1794691, 243817, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good take.  I might have cropped it a little tighter and gotten rid of some of the sky.</td>', 'Good take.  I might have cropped it a little tighter and gotten rid of some of the sky.', '2005-10-19 03:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
