(1794701, 245577, 30861, '<td valign="top">"an amber meniscus"? rotflmao. nice shot in many ways though. I''m a little bothered by the extreme deviation between looking down on the base and up at the rim, it''s disconterting. And I sih the hot spots on the flames were better controlled. Finally, technically speaking the image in the glass isn''t a reflection, the wine/glass are acting as a lens and thus the image is inverted just as a camera lens inverts it. All that''s neither here nor there though. Nice shot, 7 from me.</td>', '"an amber meniscus"? rotflmao. nice shot in many ways though. I''m a little bothered by the extreme deviation between looking down on the base and up at the rim, it''s disconterting. And I sih the hot spots on the flames were better controlled. Finally, technically speaking the image in the glass isn''t a reflection, the wine/glass are acting as a lens and thus the image is inverted just as a camera lens inverts it. All that''s neither here nor there though. Nice shot, 7 from me.', '2005-10-19 04:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
