(1794969, 245799, 44963, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t see this as a reflective image.  However, once that perspective arrived at my brain this shot soared in my estimation.  This is really great.  Your use of the window/building edge and the tree to confuse and create a subtle boarder between the real and the reflected worlds really works for me.  Top shot.</td>', 'At first I didn''t see this as a reflective image.  However, once that perspective arrived at my brain this shot soared in my estimation.  This is really great.  Your use of the window/building edge and the tree to confuse and create a subtle boarder between the real and the reflected worlds really works for me.  Top shot.', '2005-10-19 08:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1794970, 244117, 41832, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-10-19 08:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1794973, 245503, 4285, '<td valign="top">That looks like a NODECO sticker on the door of the shed.  I''m guessing somewhere along the highway between Long Harbour and St. John''s.  I would have guessed there would be more Autumn colours in the trees though, being taken in the last week.<br/> <br/>Composition is good with the diagonal placement of the wharf and use of leading lines.  The eye is drawn to the bouy and then back again through the composition.  One thing I see is lack of crispness in the image.  A little USM would work wonders here.  Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'That looks like a NODECO sticker on the door of the shed.  I''m guessing somewhere along the highway between Long Harbour and St. John''s.  I would have guessed there would be more Autumn colours in the trees though, being taken in the last week. Composition is good with the diagonal placement of the wharf and use of leading lines.  The eye is drawn to the bouy and then back again through the composition.  One thing I see is lack of crispness in the image.  A little USM would work wonders here.  Hope this is helpful.', '2005-10-19 08:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1794974, 245596, 30637, '<td valign="top">Great placement of light pole</td>', 'Great placement of light pole', '2005-10-19 08:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1794981, 245136, 44963, '<td valign="top">I found this image occupied me for a long time.  You have captured so much here - water, buildings, movement - life.  I like the colour and the results of your attention to exposure detail.  I hope you do well in this challenge.  This image deserves a good score.</td>', 'I found this image occupied me for a long time.  You have captured so much here - water, buildings, movement - life.  I like the colour and the results of your attention to exposure detail.  I hope you do well in this challenge.  This image deserves a good score.', '2005-10-19 08:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1794990, 245001, 44963, '<td valign="top">This is a classic ''reflection in water'' image.  You have captured it very well.  I know we often see such scenes but few take the time to compose and time their shots as well as this one.  Congrats.</td>', 'This is a classic ''reflection in water'' image.  You have captured it very well.  I know we often see such scenes but few take the time to compose and time their shots as well as this one.  Congrats.', '2005-10-19 08:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1794994, 243505, 25728, '<td valign="top">Dogfish Head!  Ok, when this is over - I am coming down for a GTG near YOU! :)<br/>And I like your shot, its different - industrial. The birds are a good contrast- for composition, I would have liked to see the whole shot tighter (shot maybe from a lower to the ground perspective) to bring the birds closer, the buliding lower and the reflection tighter. Overall, a solid 7 from me. :)</td>', 'Dogfish Head!  Ok, when this is over - I am coming down for a GTG near YOU! :)And I like your shot, its different - industrial. The birds are a good contrast- for composition, I would have liked to see the whole shot tighter (shot maybe from a lower to the ground perspective) to bring the birds closer, the buliding lower and the reflection tighter. Overall, a solid 7 from me. :)', '2005-10-19 09:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795002, 245854, 44963, '<td valign="top">I have not looked a large number of images in this challenge yet, but this is the first one that is purely of the reflection (ie. no reference to the actual objects - it''s great.  I hadn''t dreamed of taking the concept of reflection to this point.  I hope your image rates well.  It deserves it.</td>', 'I have not looked a large number of images in this challenge yet, but this is the first one that is purely of the reflection (ie. no reference to the actual objects - it''s great.  I hadn''t dreamed of taking the concept of reflection to this point.  I hope your image rates well.  It deserves it.', '2005-10-19 09:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795012, 244224, 44963, '<td valign="top">I am soooo envious of people who get an opportunity like this during a challenge (ie. to get an interesting, action shot that is bang on the money).  However, I take my hat off to those who manage to exploit it by taking a bloody good photo.  Congrats.</td>', 'I am soooo envious of people who get an opportunity like this during a challenge (ie. to get an interesting, action shot that is bang on the money).  However, I take my hat off to those who manage to exploit it by taking a bloody good photo.  Congrats.', '2005-10-19 09:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795013, 243357, 7181, '<td valign="top">I can see you. Still a very cool shot.</td>', 'I can see you. Still a very cool shot.', '2005-10-19 09:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795018, 244260, 42514, '<td valign="top">This Photo certainly merits a ribbon. Well done my friend...</td>', 'This Photo certainly merits a ribbon. Well done my friend...', '2005-10-19 09:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795023, 244975, 7181, '<td valign="top">This is very clever and it made me laugh. Very well done.</td>', 'This is very clever and it made me laugh. Very well done.', '2005-10-19 09:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795028, 244320, 42514, '<td valign="top">I like the colour of that leaf... nice pic</td>', 'I like the colour of that leaf... nice pic', '2005-10-19 09:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795049, 245992, 7181, '<td valign="top">Very intersting, nice comp.</td>', 'Very intersting, nice comp.', '2005-10-19 09:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795059, 244222, 7181, '<td valign="top">Good stock shot for Titleist! Nicely done.</td>', 'Good stock shot for Titleist! Nicely done.', '2005-10-19 09:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795064, 243745, 7181, '<td valign="top">Very clever.</td>', 'Very clever.', '2005-10-19 09:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795101, 244049, 27137, '<td valign="top">i don''t have my magnifying glass, other ways i would give this pict a 8</td>', 'i don''t have my magnifying glass, other ways i would give this pict a 8', '2005-10-19 09:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795110, 244928, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of your photo is the left half. For me, I wish there was a bit more contrast on the right hand side as it is so dark, but I like the tones you chose to use.</td>', 'My favorite part of your photo is the left half. For me, I wish there was a bit more contrast on the right hand side as it is so dark, but I like the tones you chose to use.', '2005-10-19 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1795115, 245249, 41675, '<td valign="top">I do like the colorful reflections. I think if you were able to rotate this about 0.3 degrees counter-clockwise (or more to straightern out the columns) it would be even more effective.</td>', 'I do like the colorful reflections. I think if you were able to rotate this about 0.3 degrees counter-clockwise (or more to straightern out the columns) it would be even more effective.', '2005-10-19 09:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795118, 243505, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your title...for some strange reason after reading it the old TV show Laverne &amp; Shirley popped into my head and now I can''t get the theme song out. LOL. Nice shot, I like it.</td>', 'I like your title...for some strange reason after reading it the old TV show Laverne & Shirley popped into my head and now I can''t get the theme song out. LOL. Nice shot, I like it.', '2005-10-19 09:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795122, 244963, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and idea, but those egg whites look unaturally green and the eggs a bit on the bluish side.</td>', 'I like the composition and idea, but those egg whites look unaturally green and the eggs a bit on the bluish side.', '2005-10-19 09:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795136, 245845, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful structure. I love the various colors on the doors and windows. If the water had been a bit more still thus giving you an even crisper reflection I would have given you a ten. 8</td>', 'What a beautiful structure. I love the various colors on the doors and windows. If the water had been a bit more still thus giving you an even crisper reflection I would have given you a ten. 8', '2005-10-19 10:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795142, 244049, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish your photo was larger, closer to the maximum of 640 pixels that is allowed in the challenge guidelines. It looks like a good shot, but bigger is better, IMO.</td>', 'For me, I wish your photo was larger, closer to the maximum of 640 pixels that is allowed in the challenge guidelines. It looks like a good shot, but bigger is better, IMO.', '2005-10-19 10:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795153, 246353, 42392, '<td valign="top">great picture, i love the way the colors blend together.</td>', 'great picture, i love the way the colors blend together.', '2005-10-19 10:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795164, 243483, 35322, '<td valign="top">I can see you :-))) weren''t we supposed to keep the camera out of shot????????</td>', 'I can see you :-))) weren''t we supposed to keep the camera out of shot????????', '2005-10-19 10:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795174, 246387, 42392, '<td valign="top">great picture,great title</td>', 'great picture,great title', '2005-10-19 10:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
