(1795269, 244954, 27207, '<td valign="top">The picture is very neat...the composition needs improvement...maybe a vertical format would have been more appealing</td>', 'The picture is very neat...the composition needs improvement...maybe a vertical format would have been more appealing', '2005-10-19 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795273, 244962, 27207, '<td valign="top">good image...but the while line running in the centre of the yellow building ruins it all</td>', 'good image...but the while line running in the centre of the yellow building ruins it all', '2005-10-19 10:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795275, 244782, 45435, '<td valign="top">Finally, somon who gets it.</td>', 'Finally, somon who gets it.', '2005-10-19 10:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795282, 246219, 45435, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and rich. Shazam! This one''s on the money. How did you make the moon look like the sun? It''s mysterious and inviting. What a wonderful place to relax. You are too good for this site. You obviously know how to handle your equipment. 10 - 10 - 10!</td>', 'Beautiful and rich. Shazam! This one''s on the money. How did you make the moon look like the sun? It''s mysterious and inviting. What a wonderful place to relax. You are too good for this site. You obviously know how to handle your equipment. 10 - 10 - 10!', '2005-10-19 11:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795286, 244084, 45435, '<td valign="top">Is this reflextion or refraction? Who cares, I like it.</td>', 'Is this reflextion or refraction? Who cares, I like it.', '2005-10-19 11:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795292, 246447, 27207, '<td valign="top">Dramatic image....but the composition should have been much tighter and the lower black portion could have been excluded</td>', 'Dramatic image....but the composition should have been much tighter and the lower black portion could have been excluded', '2005-10-19 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795294, 246430, 30608, '<td valign="top">A little more detail of the ball placement with the words in front or back reflecting off the club would have kicked this up a notch in quality. 7</td>', 'A little more detail of the ball placement with the words in front or back reflecting off the club would have kicked this up a notch in quality. 7', '2005-10-19 11:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795309, 245922, 44107, '<td valign="top">This is not a reflection.  It''s a reproduction.</td>', 'This is not a reflection.  It''s a reproduction.', '2005-10-19 11:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795310, 245969, 45435, '<td valign="top">love it!</td>', 'love it!', '2005-10-19 11:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795312, 246212, 32084, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea and the potential for the composition.  To me though, for this challenge the reflections should be more prominent, defined and probably a little different than the usual water shot.  Regardless I do like where you were going with this.</td>', 'I really like the idea and the potential for the composition.  To me though, for this challenge the reflections should be more prominent, defined and probably a little different than the usual water shot.  Regardless I do like where you were going with this.', '2005-10-19 11:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795315, 244078, 32084, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very clean.  Not an easy shot.  There are just so many water shots that in order to "Creatively photograph a reflecting surface that is not a mirror" and stand above the rest there has to be some grabber.  I will be back to re-evaluate after I look through the rest of the shots.</td>', 'Very nice, very clean.  Not an easy shot.  There are just so many water shots that in order to "Creatively photograph a reflecting surface that is not a mirror" and stand above the rest there has to be some grabber.  I will be back to re-evaluate after I look through the rest of the shots.', '2005-10-19 11:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795318, 244902, 32084, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but something happened technically.  Did you alter the colors for a creative approach?  If so, for me it doesnlt work.  If not, then there are some technical issues that should be addressed.  Also, since we are going for refections, I would change the POV to avoid the trees on the right that obscure most of the reflections.</td>', 'Neat idea, but something happened technically.  Did you alter the colors for a creative approach?  If so, for me it doesnlt work.  If not, then there are some technical issues that should be addressed.  Also, since we are going for refections, I would change the POV to avoid the trees on the right that obscure most of the reflections.', '2005-10-19 11:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795327, 244629, 32084, '<td valign="top">Nice.  The white on the bird is too hot and detail has been lost though.  I took one of these types of shots and submitted it somewhere.  Many folks loved it, but the guys that totally slammed me were right and they ended up being very helpful.  Maybe next time try to adjust the exposure compensation down and make sure you get the wihite areas without clipping.  You probably couldn''t have fxed it with levels adjustment.  Great idea as I love the distortion as the reflection moves away from the body.</td>', 'Nice.  The white on the bird is too hot and detail has been lost though.  I took one of these types of shots and submitted it somewhere.  Many folks loved it, but the guys that totally slammed me were right and they ended up being very helpful.  Maybe next time try to adjust the exposure compensation down and make sure you get the wihite areas without clipping.  You probably couldn''t have fxed it with levels adjustment.  Great idea as I love the distortion as the reflection moves away from the body.', '2005-10-19 11:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795336, 246397, 32084, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and the couds and moon offer a little something extra.  However, the moon area is too hot causing it to be distracting and a general loss of detail.  Next time maybe try to set your exposure on the moon and compensate down a little.</td>', 'Neat idea and the couds and moon offer a little something extra.  However, the moon area is too hot causing it to be distracting and a general loss of detail.  Next time maybe try to set your exposure on the moon and compensate down a little.', '2005-10-19 11:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795340, 246049, 32084, '<td valign="top">Nice. (Maybe a little too over sharpened.) There are just so many water shots that in order to "Creatively photograph a reflecting surface that is not a mirror" and stand above the rest there has to be some grabber.  I will be back to re-evaluate after I look through the rest of the shots.</td>', 'Nice. (Maybe a little too over sharpened.) There are just so many water shots that in order to "Creatively photograph a reflecting surface that is not a mirror" and stand above the rest there has to be some grabber.  I will be back to re-evaluate after I look through the rest of the shots.', '2005-10-19 11:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795341, 245837, 32084, '<td valign="top">Nice. There are just so many water shots that in order to "Creatively photograph a reflecting surface that is not a mirror" and stand above the rest there has to be some grabber.  I will be back to re-evaluate after I look through the rest of the shots.</td>', 'Nice. There are just so many water shots that in order to "Creatively photograph a reflecting surface that is not a mirror" and stand above the rest there has to be some grabber.  I will be back to re-evaluate after I look through the rest of the shots.', '2005-10-19 11:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795344, 243357, 32084, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.   Part of the challenge as specficed was to keep you and your camera out of the shot though.  Also, it might have really been neat to theme base the reflection, like going out to a roadside diner for example.</td>', 'Neat idea.   Part of the challenge as specficed was to keep you and your camera out of the shot though.  Also, it might have really been neat to theme base the reflection, like going out to a roadside diner for example.', '2005-10-19 11:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795347, 243813, 32084, '<td valign="top">This could be fabulous.  For me I just need a little more detail somewhere to get a handle on what it is.  Without the title I would be lost.  You have good focus on one part, but for me it isn;t enough to get what I am looking at.  Very cleaver idea.</td>', 'This could be fabulous.  For me I just need a little more detail somewhere to get a handle on what it is.  Without the title I would be lost.  You have good focus on one part, but for me it isn;t enough to get what I am looking at.  Very cleaver idea.', '2005-10-19 11:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795349, 246435, 32084, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but there is so much going on that it is very hard for me to see what I am looking at.  You had the benefit of seeing the entire scene and then finding an interesting part.  Those of us seeing only this part might struggle a little as I am.</td>', 'Neat idea, but there is so much going on that it is very hard for me to see what I am looking at.  You had the benefit of seeing the entire scene and then finding an interesting part.  Those of us seeing only this part might struggle a little as I am.', '2005-10-19 11:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795350, 246028, 32084, '<td valign="top">Nice. There are just so many water shots that in order to "Creatively photograph a reflecting surface that is not a mirror" and stand above the rest there has to be some grabber.  I will be back to re-evaluate after I look through the rest of the shots.</td>', 'Nice. There are just so many water shots that in order to "Creatively photograph a reflecting surface that is not a mirror" and stand above the rest there has to be some grabber.  I will be back to re-evaluate after I look through the rest of the shots.', '2005-10-19 11:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795355, 245254, 32084, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  I think a little more is needed though.  For example, if you could have a blurred shopper walking by that might have been an added bonus.</td>', 'Neat idea.  I think a little more is needed though.  For example, if you could have a blurred shopper walking by that might have been an added bonus.', '2005-10-19 11:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795357, 244782, 2223, '<td valign="top">Wow, lovely colors! 10</td>', 'Wow, lovely colors! 10', '2005-10-19 11:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
