(1795855, 244902, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow, something weird going on here with the colours. Looks way over sharpened or over saturated. Whatever you did, it does not enhance this photo. Too bad because I think taken properly this could be an ok image.</td>', 'Wow, something weird going on here with the colours. Looks way over sharpened or over saturated. Whatever you did, it does not enhance this photo. Too bad because I think taken properly this could be an ok image.', '2005-10-19 15:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795856, 245738, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any reflections.</td>', 'I don''t see any reflections.', '2005-10-19 15:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795857, 244328, 46085, '<td valign="top">I like the pins with reflection, but it took me a while to notice.  If there were more of that and less of everything else.</td>', 'I like the pins with reflection, but it took me a while to notice.  If there were more of that and less of everything else.', '2005-10-19 15:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795876, 246306, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think you should have cropped out more of the speaker, and I wouldn''t know what the reflection was if you didn''t tell me in your title.  I would like to see a picture of the egg, though.</td>', 'I think you should have cropped out more of the speaker, and I wouldn''t know what the reflection was if you didn''t tell me in your title.  I would like to see a picture of the egg, though.', '2005-10-19 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795888, 244881, 37544, '<td valign="top">just beautiful!</td>', 'just beautiful!', '2005-10-19 15:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795893, 246392, 43565, '<td valign="top">Is this a reflection?</td>', 'Is this a reflection?', '2005-10-19 15:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795898, 244172, 43565, '<td valign="top">Challenge details:  Creatively photograph a reflecting surface that is not a mirror while keeping your camera out of the shot.  <br/>While this is a reflection of feelings, it is not a reflecting surface.</td>', 'Challenge details:  Creatively photograph a reflecting surface that is not a mirror while keeping your camera out of the shot.  While this is a reflection of feelings, it is not a reflecting surface.', '2005-10-19 15:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795900, 244810, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the focus on the bell and the reflection.</td>', 'I would like to see the focus on the bell and the reflection.', '2005-10-19 15:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795903, 244400, 43565, '<td valign="top">IMO the foreground breaks the spell of the mountains and relflection.</td>', 'IMO the foreground breaks the spell of the mountains and relflection.', '2005-10-19 15:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795912, 245503, 42005, '<td valign="top">Upon first, second and now third looks, your photograph remains my <br/>favorite.  I see the clarity of focus of the house and even the sailboat <br/>in the backi.  The colors are so real.  No doubt this would be an interesting<br/>spot to take photos each season.  Good work and thankyou for sharing.</td>', 'Upon first, second and now third looks, your photograph remains my favorite.  I see the clarity of focus of the house and even the sailboat in the backi.  The colors are so real.  No doubt this would be an interestingspot to take photos each season.  Good work and thankyou for sharing.', '2005-10-19 15:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795913, 244395, 42005, '<td valign="top">Delightful!  Thank you for sharing.</td>', 'Delightful!  Thank you for sharing.', '2005-10-19 15:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795915, 245104, 42005, '<td valign="top">What an apropos title for a well done photograp.<br/>I do so like it, though it is sad.</td>', 'What an apropos title for a well done photograp.I do so like it, though it is sad.', '2005-10-19 15:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795917, 244963, 42005, '<td valign="top">Just totally and utterly amazing!</td>', 'Just totally and utterly amazing!', '2005-10-19 15:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795919, 244319, 42005, '<td valign="top">Being a jaguar fan, I was partial to this immediately.  Love the paws<br/>in the mirror image.</td>', 'Being a jaguar fan, I was partial to this immediately.  Love the pawsin the mirror image.', '2005-10-19 15:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795926, 245855, 42005, '<td valign="top">Oh, how emotive.  Beautiful lighting.  Great tones. They<br/>fit the subject.  The mirror image is hauntingly emotive<br/>in itself. Thank you for sharing.  Great job.</td>', 'Oh, how emotive.  Beautiful lighting.  Great tones. Theyfit the subject.  The mirror image is hauntingly emotivein itself. Thank you for sharing.  Great job.', '2005-10-19 16:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795928, 244892, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t consider a shadow a reflection, and most painted walls are not reflective surfaces.</td>', 'I don''t consider a shadow a reflection, and most painted walls are not reflective surfaces.', '2005-10-19 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795929, 244057, 42005, '<td valign="top">Wow. You must have used alot of paper towels to get that <br/>stainless steel that shiny.  Interesting subject. I like the way<br/>one dispenser has the urinals and the other the sinks. Great<br/>eye!</td>', 'Wow. You must have used alot of paper towels to get that stainless steel that shiny.  Interesting subject. I like the wayone dispenser has the urinals and the other the sinks. Greateye!', '2005-10-19 16:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795933, 246306, 42005, '<td valign="top">Quite intriguing shot.  I like it very much.</td>', 'Quite intriguing shot.  I like it very much.', '2005-10-19 16:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795936, 246228, 45528, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail on the eyes. Great reflection :)</td>', 'Amazing detail on the eyes. Great reflection :)', '2005-10-19 16:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795937, 244359, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow...or should I say...bow-wow (sorry, couldn''t resist) I love it! Great concept and execution. I like the color treatment you chose. I hope you get a ribbon.</td>', 'Wow...or should I say...bow-wow (sorry, couldn''t resist) I love it! Great concept and execution. I like the color treatment you chose. I hope you get a ribbon.', '2005-10-19 16:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795942, 246423, 43404, '<td valign="top">WOW! Awesome image!  As it seems to be a refraction rather than a reflection it does not meet the challenge but it still get''s a 6 for coolness.</td>', 'WOW! Awesome image!  As it seems to be a refraction rather than a reflection it does not meet the challenge but it still get''s a 6 for coolness.', '2005-10-19 16:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795943, 246157, 43404, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I would love to see this with sronger colors but the reflection is awesome! 7</td>', 'Very nice. I would love to see this with sronger colors but the reflection is awesome! 7', '2005-10-19 16:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795946, 245949, 43565, '<td valign="top">I do not consider pine needles a reflective surface.</td>', 'I do not consider pine needles a reflective surface.', '2005-10-19 16:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795948, 246213, 37818, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but I question whether it fits the rules.....</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but I question whether it fits the rules.....', '2005-10-19 16:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795950, 243838, 43404, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2005-10-19 16:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795972, 245738, 43404, '<td valign="top">DNMC but it is still very cute!</td>', 'DNMC but it is still very cute!', '2005-10-19 16:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795976, 245694, 43221, '<td valign="top">could do without the pedestrian. maybe even crop out everything but the reflection. still a great shot.</td>', 'could do without the pedestrian. maybe even crop out everything but the reflection. still a great shot.', '2005-10-19 16:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795977, 246135, 35741, '<td valign="top">A good idea but a pic is in full too messy. If you had concentrated only on the reflection on water the photo would have been more mysterious and interesting, I think.</td>', 'A good idea but a pic is in full too messy. If you had concentrated only on the reflection on water the photo would have been more mysterious and interesting, I think.', '2005-10-19 16:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1795980, 244882, 43221, '<td valign="top">i''m interested in knowing how you did this. :-)</td>', 'i''m interested in knowing how you did this. :-)', '2005-10-19 16:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
