(1796760, 244959, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that this isn''t "reflection" in the traditional sense.  Nice light on her face.  Very emotive.  She''s not only reflecting, but you can see her face in the glass - double whammy.   This would work for me if the glass reflection were completely gone, you cropped just past it and zoomed in more on her face.  This might be good with sepia as well - to make it have that nostalgic sense.  Nicely composed and executed.</td>', 'I like that this isn''t "reflection" in the traditional sense.  Nice light on her face.  Very emotive.  She''s not only reflecting, but you can see her face in the glass - double whammy.   This would work for me if the glass reflection were completely gone, you cropped just past it and zoomed in more on her face.  This might be good with sepia as well - to make it have that nostalgic sense.  Nicely composed and executed.', '2005-10-19 21:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
