(1796789, 245943, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a pretty setting.  It is screaming for post editing though.  You could get a great effect and still be allowed under basic editing, if you''d just adjust curves. The richness of the yellows and greens would really appear.  You could also do a selective color adjustment on green, red , yellow and cyan, and that would boost the WOW factor as well. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'What a pretty setting.  It is screaming for post editing though.  You could get a great effect and still be allowed under basic editing, if you''d just adjust curves. The richness of the yellows and greens would really appear.  You could also do a selective color adjustment on green, red , yellow and cyan, and that would boost the WOW factor as well. Hope this is helpful.', '2005-10-19 21:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
