(1797922, 244936, 15407, '<td valign="top">A HONKING shot... the reflection isn''t as impressive as the capture of the Honkers, yet it''s a GREAT photo ! Well Done!</td>', 'A HONKING shot... the reflection isn''t as impressive as the capture of the Honkers, yet it''s a GREAT photo ! Well Done!', '2005-10-20 06:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
