(1797927, 244320, 15407, '<td valign="top">The leaf distracts from the reflection... What I mean to say is that the leaf is most excellent and the reflection is secondary... The potential for making this photo even better trancends basic editing...</td>', 'The leaf distracts from the reflection... What I mean to say is that the leaf is most excellent and the reflection is secondary... The potential for making this photo even better trancends basic editing...', '2005-10-20 06:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
