(1797931, 245295, 22561, '<td valign="top">I took a similar photo a couple of weeks ago,with a similar problem...the light spots on the log are blown. Otherwise, it''s pretty, but the composition could be better.</td>', 'I took a similar photo a couple of weeks ago,with a similar problem...the light spots on the log are blown. Otherwise, it''s pretty, but the composition could be better.', '2005-10-20 06:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
