(1799046, 245473, 42714, '<td valign="top">Shooting glass towers in the sun is harder than most people think.  My advice to you would be to pick a different angle so that your lens isn''t capturing the sun.  The colors in your photo will appear more balanced, and the sun won''t draw so much attention.  The other thing, I''d consider doing something where the tree was either part of the composition in a more purposeful manner or shoot so that it''s not visible at all.</td>', 'Shooting glass towers in the sun is harder than most people think.  My advice to you would be to pick a different angle so that your lens isn''t capturing the sun.  The colors in your photo will appear more balanced, and the sun won''t draw so much attention.  The other thing, I''d consider doing something where the tree was either part of the composition in a more purposeful manner or shoot so that it''s not visible at all.', '2005-10-20 17:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
