(1799115, 244261, 14414, '<td valign="top">you''ve captured the delicate reflections of the water in a nice abstract composition.  i''d like to see if the composition becomes more dynamic at a slant (?)<br/> <br/>oh, and that OOF bit on the right really bugs me ;)</td>', 'you''ve captured the delicate reflections of the water in a nice abstract composition.  i''d like to see if the composition becomes more dynamic at a slant (?) oh, and that OOF bit on the right really bugs me ;)', '2005-10-20 18:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799123, 244444, 14414, '<td valign="top">i think...the boat model is inside the window, and church and building are reflected. right? its an interesting idea, and i like the the different elements competing for focus, but this does make the composition a little cluttered.</td>', 'i think...the boat model is inside the window, and church and building are reflected. right? its an interesting idea, and i like the the different elements competing for focus, but this does make the composition a little cluttered.', '2005-10-20 18:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799126, 245837, 14414, '<td valign="top">nice composition, nice colours, but it seems the light is only on the background hills, not lighting the foreground, giving quite a flat photo. Would be greatly improved with better light</td>', 'nice composition, nice colours, but it seems the light is only on the background hills, not lighting the foreground, giving quite a flat photo. Would be greatly improved with better light', '2005-10-20 18:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799128, 245937, 40371, '<td valign="top">Very cool but way too small.</td>', 'Very cool but way too small.', '2005-10-20 18:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799131, 244766, 40371, '<td valign="top">Cool concept, bad execution.</td>', 'Cool concept, bad execution.', '2005-10-20 18:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799132, 246219, 30392, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I love the mood. well done!</td>', 'Very nice, I love the mood. well done!', '2005-10-20 18:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799133, 245261, 14414, '<td valign="top">compositions just about perfect; but i would like perhaps to see the crop a little less tight on the right. the reflected light has a beautiful velvety texture and the shapes and angles of the buildings complement each other</td>', 'compositions just about perfect; but i would like perhaps to see the crop a little less tight on the right. the reflected light has a beautiful velvety texture and the shapes and angles of the buildings complement each other', '2005-10-20 18:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799134, 244379, 40371, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you have gotten this a dozen times at least..."reflections without mirrors" would be the theme</td>', 'I''m sure you have gotten this a dozen times at least..."reflections without mirrors" would be the theme', '2005-10-20 18:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799139, 244117, 14414, '<td valign="top">nice shapes, well observed. the title helps give it character. tones in water are nice, but i think the composition would be improved if it were slightly less centred</td>', 'nice shapes, well observed. the title helps give it character. tones in water are nice, but i think the composition would be improved if it were slightly less centred', '2005-10-20 18:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799146, 244833, 14414, '<td valign="top">i relaly like the two evening scenes complement each other, and the way they don''t fight for attention, but that theres a kind of gradient where one fades out and other becomes more clear I''d prefer the wine glasses to not be there, because they''re not an ontegral part of the composition but just get in the way.<br/>muted colours are perfect. very nice image overall</td>', 'i relaly like the two evening scenes complement each other, and the way they don''t fight for attention, but that theres a kind of gradient where one fades out and other becomes more clear I''d prefer the wine glasses to not be there, because they''re not an ontegral part of the composition but just get in the way.muted colours are perfect. very nice image overall', '2005-10-20 18:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799150, 244927, 45857, '<td valign="top">Very good water reflection, is this part of Monet''s water lily series?<br/>Not sure about the title, read  ''Fragrant'' and thought of reflections off the sewage plant. Perhaps lost in translation</td>', 'Very good water reflection, is this part of Monet''s water lily series?Not sure about the title, read  ''Fragrant'' and thought of reflections off the sewage plant. Perhaps lost in translation', '2005-10-20 18:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799157, 244358, 45857, '<td valign="top">Great capture....can''t see the camera, just your lights so ....phhhhhht....<br/>Also can''t see the hundreds of soap rings from your failed attempts.  8</td>', 'Great capture....can''t see the camera, just your lights so ....phhhhhht....Also can''t see the hundreds of soap rings from your failed attempts.  8', '2005-10-20 18:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799158, 244198, 14414, '<td valign="top">i really like the quirky way there are 2 images, which look similar but one is quiet + still, the other has action and people. is it really a reflection though, or is it a distirted view straight thru the glass.?</td>', 'i really like the quirky way there are 2 images, which look similar but one is quiet + still, the other has action and people. is it really a reflection though, or is it a distirted view straight thru the glass.?', '2005-10-20 18:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799166, 244954, 30392, '<td valign="top">Wow! Such still water... Nice house too! well captured</td>', 'Wow! Such still water... Nice house too! well captured', '2005-10-20 18:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799171, 244676, 45857, '<td valign="top">Yes, I see reflection and nice macro shot, but you must live in a dull (non-reflective) world if this is the most inspiring thing.</td>', 'Yes, I see reflection and nice macro shot, but you must live in a dull (non-reflective) world if this is the most inspiring thing.', '2005-10-20 18:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
