(1799174, 244313, 40371, '<td valign="top">The reflection is really clear but its just too busy, I really have to concentrate to distinguish between different areas.</td>', 'The reflection is really clear but its just too busy, I really have to concentrate to distinguish between different areas.', '2005-10-20 18:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
