(1799191, 245348, 45857, '<td valign="top">Either nature''s reflection is lost in the bushes, the picture is too good and I can''t tell what I''m looking at.</td>', 'Either nature''s reflection is lost in the bushes, the picture is too good and I can''t tell what I''m looking at.', '2005-10-20 19:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
