(1799294, 245969, 29906, '<td valign="top">Haha, this is scary .. But great idea .. Just wish you used smaller aperture to get the whole scene in focus.</td>', 'Haha, this is scary .. But great idea .. Just wish you used smaller aperture to get the whole scene in focus.', '2005-10-20 19:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
