(1799406, 246222, 30817, '<td valign="top">Great tones and the striations on the reflecting surface are super!  I like your inclusion of the lamp and the yellow traffic light body in this composition.  Can''t say the same for the car and "Do not enter" sign.</td>', 'Great tones and the striations on the reflecting surface are super!  I like your inclusion of the lamp and the yellow traffic light body in this composition.  Can''t say the same for the car and "Do not enter" sign.', '2005-10-20 20:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
