(1799753, 244902, 35739, '<td valign="top">There is a lot wrong with this image. I like the location and your content.  The sky is very harsh, saturation seems to be overdone here. I rechecked my monitor.  Colors of the tree trunks are bluish to me.  Looks like you may have oversharpened the image. There is a noticable bluring halo around the tree trunks. There are focus issues also.  I would go back here and take more photos. This area looks real nice.  Nice try.</td>', 'There is a lot wrong with this image. I like the location and your content.  The sky is very harsh, saturation seems to be overdone here. I rechecked my monitor.  Colors of the tree trunks are bluish to me.  Looks like you may have oversharpened the image. There is a noticable bluring halo around the tree trunks. There are focus issues also.  I would go back here and take more photos. This area looks real nice.  Nice try.', '2005-10-20 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799754, 245319, 39057, '<td valign="top">Wow...at first I did not see the reflection because of my monitor''s setting. I thought it was a bad fit for the challenge. Then..I scrolled down and saw the puddle. It is like the reflection on the puddle is filling in for what is missing on the top "crop" of this photo. Great crop job on the top to give the reflection some meaning.This is different than any others that I have seen. 9</td>', 'Wow...at first I did not see the reflection because of my monitor''s setting. I thought it was a bad fit for the challenge. Then..I scrolled down and saw the puddle. It is like the reflection on the puddle is filling in for what is missing on the top "crop" of this photo. Great crop job on the top to give the reflection some meaning.This is different than any others that I have seen. 9', '2005-10-20 22:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799758, 243838, 39057, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-10-20 22:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
