(1799763, 244439, 35739, '<td valign="top">Colors appear to be alittle oversaturated.  Gives it a unreal appearance.  Shows up in the water and the washed out look of much of the orange in the trees.  Looks like a beautiful area.</td>', 'Colors appear to be alittle oversaturated.  Gives it a unreal appearance.  Shows up in the water and the washed out look of much of the orange in the trees.  Looks like a beautiful area.', '2005-10-20 22:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
