(1799767, 246451, 35739, '<td valign="top">When you show a entire reflection and nothing to see other than the reflection, it is hard when the image appears out of focus.</td>', 'When you show a entire reflection and nothing to see other than the reflection, it is hard when the image appears out of focus.', '2005-10-20 22:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
