(1799805, 244328, 35739, '<td valign="top">Ok, Where are her bowling shoes? Drop a ball on her toes and you will never hear the end of it.  Colors do not seem right here.  Notice the hands.  Perhaps a little too much color balance here. What are you focusing on?  The ball? The little girl?  Nothing here appears in focus.  Looks closer to the ball as the focus point.  When you have so much in the image and if only the small reflection is what is in focus, it does not do the image good.  My thoughts only. Hope she got a strike.</td>', 'Ok, Where are her bowling shoes? Drop a ball on her toes and you will never hear the end of it.  Colors do not seem right here.  Notice the hands.  Perhaps a little too much color balance here. What are you focusing on?  The ball? The little girl?  Nothing here appears in focus.  Looks closer to the ball as the focus point.  When you have so much in the image and if only the small reflection is what is in focus, it does not do the image good.  My thoughts only. Hope she got a strike.', '2005-10-20 22:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
