(1800208, 243817, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this and good title.  While not normally a ''fan'' of ''flipping'' reflections, etc (and apologies if you somehow have not), I think it works very well with this shot.  Criticism; not sure for ''calmer waters'', with this one, as I like the ''warped time'' look, which your title is apt for.  Somehow, a more ''dreamy'' or ''surreal'' look obtained would be good, but unsure how, perhaps the coloring and/or light (sky especially).  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '8 - Like this and good title.  While not normally a ''fan'' of ''flipping'' reflections, etc (and apologies if you somehow have not), I think it works very well with this shot.  Criticism; not sure for ''calmer waters'', with this one, as I like the ''warped time'' look, which your title is apt for.  Somehow, a more ''dreamy'' or ''surreal'' look obtained would be good, but unsure how, perhaps the coloring and/or light (sky especially).  Not sure on the frame.', '2005-10-21 01:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800209, 246304, 45857, '<td valign="top">Love old gas stuff, but reflection just isn''t compelling element<br/></td>', 'Love old gas stuff, but reflection just isn''t compelling element', '2005-10-21 01:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800215, 244117, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this, especially the colors.  Criticism; perhaps a different crop, incorporating more ''fore reflection'' and less ''top of tree''.  Perhaps the ''distant waters edge'' softened somehow may have made this better in my opinion.  The soft ripple effect works nicely here.</td>', '8 - Like this, especially the colors.  Criticism; perhaps a different crop, incorporating more ''fore reflection'' and less ''top of tree''.  Perhaps the ''distant waters edge'' softened somehow may have made this better in my opinion.  The soft ripple effect works nicely here.', '2005-10-21 01:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800223, 246377, 45857, '<td valign="top">Must be a wonderful place to shoot, however I don''t think this is your best image from the site, or the best use of reflection. The reflection seems forced, the sky over shadows the falls</td>', 'Must be a wonderful place to shoot, however I don''t think this is your best image from the site, or the best use of reflection. The reflection seems forced, the sky over shadows the falls', '2005-10-21 01:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800225, 246387, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Like the color combinations, very soft.  Criticism; might be wrong but seems to me the ''focus'' is on the ''real'' and not the reflection, so I would like to see the focus there, which would also make that ''more dominant''.  Even a different crop (albeit making a different picture) excluding the bridge would be nice, but I do like the different ''aspect'' with the bridge incorporated.  A touch ''grainy'' especially in the fore waters, but again, if the focus were directed different perhaps this could have been avoided, even if it meant the ''sky'' gained it.  Apologies if I am incorrect on the focussing.  Like the title and was/am impressed with the ''moonrise''/shine - unique.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Like the color combinations, very soft.  Criticism; might be wrong but seems to me the ''focus'' is on the ''real'' and not the reflection, so I would like to see the focus there, which would also make that ''more dominant''.  Even a different crop (albeit making a different picture) excluding the bridge would be nice, but I do like the different ''aspect'' with the bridge incorporated.  A touch ''grainy'' especially in the fore waters, but again, if the focus were directed different perhaps this could have been avoided, even if it meant the ''sky'' gained it.  Apologies if I am incorrect on the focussing.  Like the title and was/am impressed with the ''moonrise''/shine - unique.', '2005-10-21 01:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800235, 245001, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice, good color combinations and capture.  Criticism; if it were possible, I keep imagining (cropping with hand in front of screen) how this would have looked cropped tighter (from right, perhaps up to the bench(?)), and then ''bigger''.  The reflection is nice as is, but I wonder if ''more reflection'' (ie: more vivid) could have been gained with a different focus, but you may have already done this (apologies if so), as I can even make out the bottom of the lake(?) at the foreground.</td>', '8 - Very nice, good color combinations and capture.  Criticism; if it were possible, I keep imagining (cropping with hand in front of screen) how this would have looked cropped tighter (from right, perhaps up to the bench(?)), and then ''bigger''.  The reflection is nice as is, but I wonder if ''more reflection'' (ie: more vivid) could have been gained with a different focus, but you may have already done this (apologies if so), as I can even make out the bottom of the lake(?) at the foreground.', '2005-10-21 01:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800238, 245497, 45857, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, but I think the desat-ed tones detract from what could have been a great interpertation. If your having as dissappointing Fall foliage where you are as we in NE Tennessee, then Its not your fault.</td>', 'Lovely photo, but I think the desat-ed tones detract from what could have been a great interpertation. If your having as dissappointing Fall foliage where you are as we in NE Tennessee, then Its not your fault.', '2005-10-21 01:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800239, 245844, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice.  Criticism; it is the ''crispness''/sharpness that appeals to me most in this shot.  A different crop, especially tighter on the right, may have made this better in my opinion.  If also possible, a ''wait'' for a ''different sky'' may have also given this something ''extra''.</td>', '8 - Nice.  Criticism; it is the ''crispness''/sharpness that appeals to me most in this shot.  A different crop, especially tighter on the right, may have made this better in my opinion.  If also possible, a ''wait'' for a ''different sky'' may have also given this something ''extra''.', '2005-10-21 01:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800244, 246389, 45857, '<td valign="top">Sorry, just no fire in it for me.  Mascara flakes really distracting. could have been cleaned up before shooting.</td>', 'Sorry, just no fire in it for me.  Mascara flakes really distracting. could have been cleaned up before shooting.', '2005-10-21 01:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800245, 244400, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - This is very nice, think I said ''wow'' when I first viewed it.  Beautiful scene.  Criticism; apologies in advance if I am wrong, but I would love to have seen the reflection sharper (the focus?) in this shot.  The water/ice(?) is so ''glass'' like, that it just seems even more potential in this shot.  The rocks at the fore are a nice effect/contrast, just unsure on if they ''dominate''/detract from this shots potential.</td>', '8 - This is very nice, think I said ''wow'' when I first viewed it.  Beautiful scene.  Criticism; apologies in advance if I am wrong, but I would love to have seen the reflection sharper (the focus?) in this shot.  The water/ice(?) is so ''glass'' like, that it just seems even more potential in this shot.  The rocks at the fore are a nice effect/contrast, just unsure on if they ''dominate''/detract from this shots potential.', '2005-10-21 01:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800249, 244954, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good reflection.  Criticism; whilst the house is well reflected, seems a little ''bland'' in my opinion, but unsure how this could be improved.  The shadows are nice dappled around, just in my opinion, the shot needs something to ''bring it alive'' more, perhaps just a different time of day/light.  I may be wrong, but seems also to me that your focus is on the reflection and not the ''real'' so well done for that.</td>', '8 - Very good reflection.  Criticism; whilst the house is well reflected, seems a little ''bland'' in my opinion, but unsure how this could be improved.  The shadows are nice dappled around, just in my opinion, the shot needs something to ''bring it alive'' more, perhaps just a different time of day/light.  I may be wrong, but seems also to me that your focus is on the reflection and not the ''real'' so well done for that.', '2005-10-21 01:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800253, 246088, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice and simple.  Nice colors and the house lighting really enhances this shot.  Criticism; difficult, given the time of day and my comment just now on the house lighting, but I would like to have somehow seen more (I can discern a fraction) of the ''mountains'' in the reflection, if possible.  A slight tighter crop on the left, cutting out that ''land/rock''(?) may have also made this better in my opinion.  The only other thing I would like to have seen (and forgive me if I am wrong) is a sharper focus on the reflection, rather than the ''real'', with perhaps (if possible) a touch more water at the ''fore''.</td>', '8 - Very nice and simple.  Nice colors and the house lighting really enhances this shot.  Criticism; difficult, given the time of day and my comment just now on the house lighting, but I would like to have somehow seen more (I can discern a fraction) of the ''mountains'' in the reflection, if possible.  A slight tighter crop on the left, cutting out that ''land/rock''(?) may have also made this better in my opinion.  The only other thing I would like to have seen (and forgive me if I am wrong) is a sharper focus on the reflection, rather than the ''real'', with perhaps (if possible) a touch more water at the ''fore''.', '2005-10-21 01:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800257, 245464, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  The lighting and colors are subtle and good.  Criticism; would like to have seen the focus on the reflection (forgive me if it is), with that a lot sharper and the ''real'' less sharp, also reducing the noise/grain(?) in the forewater.  Nice composition.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  The lighting and colors are subtle and good.  Criticism; would like to have seen the focus on the reflection (forgive me if it is), with that a lot sharper and the ''real'' less sharp, also reducing the noise/grain(?) in the forewater.  Nice composition.', '2005-10-21 01:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800260, 244318, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice and different.  Criticism; I can''t quite discern if your focus is on the dragonfly reflection or on the ''real'', but seems a sharp reflection so well done if that is where your focus was.  Maybe a different crop and a play with the coloring, may have made this a better shot in my opinion.  I like the way the ''branch''(?) has a warped reflection yet the dragonfly retains perspective.</td>', '8 - Nice and different.  Criticism; I can''t quite discern if your focus is on the dragonfly reflection or on the ''real'', but seems a sharp reflection so well done if that is where your focus was.  Maybe a different crop and a play with the coloring, may have made this a better shot in my opinion.  I like the way the ''branch''(?) has a warped reflection yet the dragonfly retains perspective.', '2005-10-21 01:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800263, 244936, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice colors.  Criticism; wish the focus were more on the reflection here even though the geese(?) make a wonderful sight, for the Challenge, (and with calmer waters), their reflections would have been ''special''.  Difficult shot I imagine trying to incorporate ''all'', while still getting those ''flying geese''.</td>', '8 - Very nice colors.  Criticism; wish the focus were more on the reflection here even though the geese(?) make a wonderful sight, for the Challenge, (and with calmer waters), their reflections would have been ''special''.  Difficult shot I imagine trying to incorporate ''all'', while still getting those ''flying geese''.', '2005-10-21 01:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800271, 245293, 45857, '<td valign="top">Its not dark enough to be goth, don''t think cemetries are the most compelling subject in this context.</td>', 'Its not dark enough to be goth, don''t think cemetries are the most compelling subject in this context.', '2005-10-21 01:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800277, 244222, 18339, '<td valign="top">Orignal idea,  a really nice shot.</td>', 'Orignal idea,  a really nice shot.', '2005-10-21 01:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800279, 245145, 45857, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, but reflection isn''t an intergral part of the image. Also seems very dirty, maybe sensor dirt.</td>', 'Like the idea, but reflection isn''t an intergral part of the image. Also seems very dirty, maybe sensor dirt.', '2005-10-21 01:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800284, 245458, 45857, '<td valign="top">Antique hard drive... I think this is a case of the reflection overwhelming the image. The clear image of the lamp taints an otherwise good effort. Phillips isn''t it?<br/></td>', 'Antique hard drive... I think this is a case of the reflection overwhelming the image. The clear image of the lamp taints an otherwise good effort. Phillips isn''t it?', '2005-10-21 01:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
