(1800331, 246422, 45857, '<td valign="top">Simply just not an inspired interpertation, everything seems so average.</td>', 'Simply just not an inspired interpertation, everything seems so average.', '2005-10-21 02:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800336, 245844, 15407, '<td valign="top">I find it hard to believe that this is a photo of a real place.. It''s otherworldly... awesome...   Wow! ... voted as real... nah this must be an excellent painting ... did you cheat?</td>', 'I find it hard to believe that this is a photo of a real place.. It''s otherworldly... awesome...   Wow! ... voted as real... nah this must be an excellent painting ... did you cheat?', '2005-10-21 02:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800337, 246125, 45857, '<td valign="top">The contrasting light on the peaks is striking, but there an overall softness. Nothing seems to quite be in focus.</td>', 'The contrasting light on the peaks is striking, but there an overall softness. Nothing seems to quite be in focus.', '2005-10-21 02:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800345, 244401, 45857, '<td valign="top">Great bird photo. The greens seem unreal. The water wants to be darker. <br/>I egret I can''t see more than an 8.</td>', 'Great bird photo. The greens seem unreal. The water wants to be darker. I egret I can''t see more than an 8.', '2005-10-21 02:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800347, 245186, 45857, '<td valign="top">Looks like a good course. Your reflection is nice effect, just not the focus of the shot.</td>', 'Looks like a good course. Your reflection is nice effect, just not the focus of the shot.', '2005-10-21 02:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800349, 244782, 15407, '<td valign="top">I love this and hate the fact that I have never been able to get a good reflection at a car show !  You made lemonade out of some fine looking ''lemons''! One of my fave''s!</td>', 'I love this and hate the fact that I have never been able to get a good reflection at a car show !  You made lemonade out of some fine looking ''lemons''! One of my fave''s!', '2005-10-21 02:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800350, 246267, 45857, '<td valign="top">You have a good sense for landscape, and certainly live in the right area. <br/>There''s a hazy quality that hurts. Thought about a UV filter?<br/>Your reflection seems like an afterthought in this picture.</td>', 'You have a good sense for landscape, and certainly live in the right area. There''s a hazy quality that hurts. Thought about a UV filter?Your reflection seems like an afterthought in this picture.', '2005-10-21 02:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800359, 245851, 45857, '<td valign="top">You have a great emotive image, hurt but using it in the challenge. <br/>Availible light just created problems when it created the reflection. <br/>Graininess and flare over her hair tarnish an otherwise good shot.</td>', 'You have a great emotive image, hurt but using it in the challenge. Availible light just created problems when it created the reflection. Graininess and flare over her hair tarnish an otherwise good shot.', '2005-10-21 03:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800362, 244049, 40126, '<td valign="top">too small. maximize your image size to 640pixels length, width or both. this will make your image more impactful.</td>', 'too small. maximize your image size to 640pixels length, width or both. this will make your image more impactful.', '2005-10-21 03:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800371, 244936, 45857, '<td valign="top">Great bird picture, really superb, but reflection neither adds or detracts from the qualitiy.</td>', 'Great bird picture, really superb, but reflection neither adds or detracts from the qualitiy.', '2005-10-21 03:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800374, 243819, 45857, '<td valign="top">Best of the eye reflections</td>', 'Best of the eye reflections', '2005-10-21 03:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800427, 245323, 14414, '<td valign="top">the tall format is interesting, but i personally would prefer it slightly squatter. the composition is good, drawing your eye to the bridge and mist behind, but i don''t like the green hue, espesially round the trees. The foreground river is a good leading line, but could be cropped a little higher</td>', 'the tall format is interesting, but i personally would prefer it slightly squatter. the composition is good, drawing your eye to the bridge and mist behind, but i don''t like the green hue, espesially round the trees. The foreground river is a good leading line, but could be cropped a little higher', '2005-10-21 04:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800434, 246452, 14414, '<td valign="top">a sharp, clear photo with good tones, but i''m not sure why you composed it like this. i mean, its clearly set up, but i dont see your aim in terms of shape, what makdes a good composition...etc</td>', 'a sharp, clear photo with good tones, but i''m not sure why you composed it like this. i mean, its clearly set up, but i dont see your aim in terms of shape, what makdes a good composition...etc', '2005-10-21 05:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800449, 245408, 18073, '<td valign="top">Cracking effort but I wonder if a slight crop would have helped this image a bit.  Cut out the buildings and pylons to the sides of the main subject and some off the top and bottom of the image and it would have a lot more impact.<br/> <br/>Also, for your own portfolio I would try and clone out the power lines, reckon that would complete the image.<br/> <br/>Great effort anyway, nice exposure and great subject.  7/10</td>', 'Cracking effort but I wonder if a slight crop would have helped this image a bit.  Cut out the buildings and pylons to the sides of the main subject and some off the top and bottom of the image and it would have a lot more impact. Also, for your own portfolio I would try and clone out the power lines, reckon that would complete the image. Great effort anyway, nice exposure and great subject.  7/10', '2005-10-21 05:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800453, 243836, 14414, '<td valign="top">i think the reflection is just the top right corner bit, in which case it doesn''t really seem to enhance the photo at all, and is just there to give a link to the challenge. Having said that, the rest of the photo is really nice. i like theabstract shapes and patterns on the ground, and the B+w works really well to bring out the tones. the two diagonals brring the composition together effectively</td>', 'i think the reflection is just the top right corner bit, in which case it doesn''t really seem to enhance the photo at all, and is just there to give a link to the challenge. Having said that, the rest of the photo is really nice. i like theabstract shapes and patterns on the ground, and the B+w works really well to bring out the tones. the two diagonals brring the composition together effectively', '2005-10-21 05:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800454, 246027, 14414, '<td valign="top">wow...nice location<br/>the slighttly off-centre composition works well, amd the tones are perfect except of course the couple of blownout areas. the reflection has been captured brilliantly, with a nice smooth feel. the slight diagonals from left to right help support the composition.</td>', 'wow...nice locationthe slighttly off-centre composition works well, amd the tones are perfect except of course the couple of blownout areas. the reflection has been captured brilliantly, with a nice smooth feel. the slight diagonals from left to right help support the composition.', '2005-10-21 05:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800455, 245714, 14414, '<td valign="top">i think the low DOF has worked effectively here, but the foreground (reeds) is a bit dull and not 100% sharp. However, the composition is spot on  and fits the challenge fine.</td>', 'i think the low DOF has worked effectively here, but the foreground (reeds) is a bit dull and not 100% sharp. However, the composition is spot on  and fits the challenge fine.', '2005-10-21 05:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800456, 244963, 14414, '<td valign="top">nicely composed still life, but i''m not sure about any wow factor.. the yellow tones in the ''white'' of the egg are weird, but i ddont think they''re a problem. lighting on the cracked egg is good, but seems a little flat on the eggs around</td>', 'nicely composed still life, but i''m not sure about any wow factor.. the yellow tones in the ''white'' of the egg are weird, but i ddont think they''re a problem. lighting on the cracked egg is good, but seems a little flat on the eggs around', '2005-10-21 05:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800458, 246124, 14414, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but i''m not sure of the almost centred composition - not  very dynamic, makes the photo a little stagnant. i would try cropping much lower at the top, so the riverboat becomes a more integral part of the image, and the composition becomes more interesting. Try this again on a sunnier day, because the lighting is very flat</td>', 'nice idea, but i''m not sure of the almost centred composition - not  very dynamic, makes the photo a little stagnant. i would try cropping much lower at the top, so the riverboat becomes a more integral part of the image, and the composition becomes more interesting. Try this again on a sunnier day, because the lighting is very flat', '2005-10-21 05:54:47.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1800460, 244009, 14414, '<td valign="top">she seems to be pulling a face, which spoils the photo somewhat. lighting is quite flat, imho. composition is good, but because of the lighting colours are dull.</td>', 'she seems to be pulling a face, which spoils the photo somewhat. lighting is quite flat, imho. composition is good, but because of the lighting colours are dull.', '2005-10-21 05:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800464, 245358, 14414, '<td valign="top">i want to see this w/out the slanting of the window frame, but i understand that would be hard w/out your reflection in the image.  but because of the slant, the horizon is wonky. I like the reflection captured, i just wish the sky was a little more dramatic.</td>', 'i want to see this w/out the slanting of the window frame, but i understand that would be hard w/out your reflection in the image.  but because of the slant, the horizon is wonky. I like the reflection captured, i just wish the sky was a little more dramatic.', '2005-10-21 05:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800466, 243838, 14414, '<td valign="top">beautiful scene, reflections captureed well. composition works fine, and is aided (imo) by the foreground bushes. Lighting could be better</td>', 'beautiful scene, reflections captureed well. composition works fine, and is aided (imo) by the foreground bushes. Lighting could be better', '2005-10-21 06:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800468, 244223, 14414, '<td valign="top">i like the slanting lines of windows, and the juxtaposition of the round building and square building</td>', 'i like the slanting lines of windows, and the juxtaposition of the round building and square building', '2005-10-21 06:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800470, 245229, 31776, '<td valign="top">Would have been better IMO if the water was stiller and if the boats were a little lower in the pic</td>', 'Would have been better IMO if the water was stiller and if the boats were a little lower in the pic', '2005-10-21 06:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800471, 244512, 14414, '<td valign="top">i think i already commented and voted on this, but doesnt look like the vote went thru properly so...i''ll try n remember what my comment was, lol<br/> <br/>really nice tones captured, good uncluttered composition but i''m not convinced about the centred comp. it did take me a little while initially to work out what i was looking at. i think it would be better with more negative space above, so the main subject sits along the bottom third line</td>', 'i think i already commented and voted on this, but doesnt look like the vote went thru properly so...i''ll try n remember what my comment was, lol really nice tones captured, good uncluttered composition but i''m not convinced about the centred comp. it did take me a little while initially to work out what i was looking at. i think it would be better with more negative space above, so the main subject sits along the bottom third line', '2005-10-21 06:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800474, 244025, 31776, '<td valign="top">Sorry just a blur to me. Can''t offer anymore than that because I can''t see from the pic what you were trying to do</td>', 'Sorry just a blur to me. Can''t offer anymore than that because I can''t see from the pic what you were trying to do', '2005-10-21 06:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
