(1800855, 244766, 43399, '<td valign="top">how does that have anything to do with the challenge? and you forgot the date on there which from my own experience i know is a problem</td>', 'how does that have anything to do with the challenge? and you forgot the date on there which from my own experience i know is a problem', '2005-10-21 11:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800868, 245888, 42171, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning shot. The area where you are is in so much shade that the contrast it creates between the sky/mountain in the backround is imense and makes for a great reflection in the lake!<br/> <br/>Is it really everest? how were you so close? I would love to go there!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning shot. The area where you are is in so much shade that the contrast it creates between the sky/mountain in the backround is imense and makes for a great reflection in the lake! Is it really everest? how were you so close? I would love to go there!', '2005-10-21 11:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800869, 244682, 42171, '<td valign="top">It is a bit difficult to work out which bits are reflection and which bits are behind the glass...</td>', 'It is a bit difficult to work out which bits are reflection and which bits are behind the glass...', '2005-10-21 11:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800871, 244025, 42171, '<td valign="top">Ooooh - erm - how do I put it...<br/> <br/>I THINK it is the reflection of the titled items in a table right? I hasn''t worked very well. I can only just make out the objects. it looks more like  an abstract... Sorry...</td>', 'Ooooh - erm - how do I put it... I THINK it is the reflection of the titled items in a table right? I hasn''t worked very well. I can only just make out the objects. it looks more like  an abstract... Sorry...', '2005-10-21 11:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800873, 245521, 30817, '<td valign="top">Lovely work and a great capture.  If mine, after the challenge, I would frame this near portrait-style by making the left border begin just to the right of (and eliminating) that bird presently upper left, bring the right border over about midway from where it is now and the right edge of the lower group of three birds looking the same direction, and finally clone out the top bird.  That way your composition has three pipers all looking to the left with some leading room on the left side of the frame.  That, to me, would make a stunning poster-sized picture.  Don''t take this wrong, it is a good-looking piece as is now.  Just has some great editing potential. 8</td>', 'Lovely work and a great capture.  If mine, after the challenge, I would frame this near portrait-style by making the left border begin just to the right of (and eliminating) that bird presently upper left, bring the right border over about midway from where it is now and the right edge of the lower group of three birds looking the same direction, and finally clone out the top bird.  That way your composition has three pipers all looking to the left with some leading room on the left side of the frame.  That, to me, would make a stunning poster-sized picture.  Don''t take this wrong, it is a good-looking piece as is now.  Just has some great editing potential. 8', '2005-10-21 11:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800875, 246165, 30817, '<td valign="top">Love the scattershot wires leaving the frame.  Nice work with a good eye for composition.</td>', 'Love the scattershot wires leaving the frame.  Nice work with a good eye for composition.', '2005-10-21 11:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800878, 245518, 42171, '<td valign="top">Is this like an "Infinity" pool or something? Really nice detail in the reflection, though I think it should have been cropped slightly more to get rid of  the line across the top. ( I guess it is the "horizon" line or "reflection point" - does it have a name!?!?)<br/>other than that - Excellent, and I''m giving it a 10!</td>', 'Is this like an "Infinity" pool or something? Really nice detail in the reflection, though I think it should have been cropped slightly more to get rid of  the line across the top. ( I guess it is the "horizon" line or "reflection point" - does it have a name!?!?)other than that - Excellent, and I''m giving it a 10!', '2005-10-21 11:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800881, 246449, 30817, '<td valign="top">Everything behind the top, windshield, hood and ornament of your subject car ruins the mood.  You would have served this piece well if you had draped a background tarp behind the Rolls for the shot. You had a very good idea.</td>', 'Everything behind the top, windshield, hood and ornament of your subject car ruins the mood.  You would have served this piece well if you had draped a background tarp behind the Rolls for the shot. You had a very good idea.', '2005-10-21 11:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800884, 246435, 42171, '<td valign="top">Bit tricky to see - have you flipped the image?</td>', 'Bit tricky to see - have you flipped the image?', '2005-10-21 11:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800885, 245922, 42171, '<td valign="top">Interesting, though the shape of your hand has not quite mirrored the pixelated graphic!</td>', 'Interesting, though the shape of your hand has not quite mirrored the pixelated graphic!', '2005-10-21 11:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800886, 244223, 42171, '<td valign="top">Nice geometric feel to this...</td>', 'Nice geometric feel to this...', '2005-10-21 11:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800887, 245506, 42171, '<td valign="top">Very smooth looking! I like it!</td>', 'Very smooth looking! I like it!', '2005-10-21 11:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800889, 243491, 30817, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the theme.  I even like the yellow cast, as a device to take this to the edge of surrealism. I suggest that you crop it tighter.  The scene, afterall, is in the glasses, the wall to the viewer''s left adds nothing of strength to the composition.  I would make the left border come to just left of his shoulder.</td>', 'Great idea for the theme.  I even like the yellow cast, as a device to take this to the edge of surrealism. I suggest that you crop it tighter.  The scene, afterall, is in the glasses, the wall to the viewer''s left adds nothing of strength to the composition.  I would make the left border come to just left of his shoulder.', '2005-10-21 11:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800894, 243817, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is nicely translated with rich, deserving colors which offsets the surreal mood of the composition.  Excellent!</td>', 'This is nicely translated with rich, deserving colors which offsets the surreal mood of the composition.  Excellent!', '2005-10-21 11:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800897, 246027, 42171, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! I have some show caves close to me, though I don''t think they have anything as interesting as this to shoot!<br/>Giving it a 10...</td>', 'Awesome shot! I have some show caves close to me, though I don''t think they have anything as interesting as this to shoot!Giving it a 10...', '2005-10-21 11:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800904, 245319, 42171, '<td valign="top">Really like this one. May have been better if you could have got more of the bridge in, though it would probably have detracted from the reflection... Who knows!<br/>a 9 I think...</td>', 'Really like this one. May have been better if you could have got more of the bridge in, though it would probably have detracted from the reflection... Who knows!a 9 I think...', '2005-10-21 11:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800905, 245772, 30817, '<td valign="top">I really, really like your idea.  For my money it is a tad congested.  Three things should go.  You pick ''em. 6</td>', 'I really, really like your idea.  For my money it is a tad congested.  Three things should go.  You pick ''em. 6', '2005-10-21 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800907, 245738, 42171, '<td valign="top">Can''t see a reflection......???</td>', 'Can''t see a reflection......???', '2005-10-21 11:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800909, 245900, 30817, '<td valign="top">Super sharp, colorful reflection. Problem is, I can''t construct the surface that is doing the reflecting.</td>', 'Super sharp, colorful reflection. Problem is, I can''t construct the surface that is doing the reflecting.', '2005-10-21 11:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800910, 245209, 42171, '<td valign="top">Why''d you make it so small???</td>', 'Why''d you make it so small???', '2005-10-21 11:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800916, 245903, 42171, '<td valign="top">Whoa! is that chrom or stainless steel!?!?! That is a cool place!</td>', 'Whoa! is that chrom or stainless steel!?!?! That is a cool place!', '2005-10-21 11:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800918, 246377, 42171, '<td valign="top">too dark...</td>', 'too dark...', '2005-10-21 11:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800922, 244892, 42171, '<td valign="top">????<br/>A shadow is not a reflection????</td>', '????A shadow is not a reflection????', '2005-10-21 11:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800926, 244155, 30817, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Original and talented in concept.  A bit over-ponderous due to the excess of increasingly black tones on the left 1/4th of your canvas.  Keeping this light and bright would have made a merrier composition, which this fights to become.  7 for all the goodness that is displayed in this melodic piece.</td>', 'Very cool!  Original and talented in concept.  A bit over-ponderous due to the excess of increasingly black tones on the left 1/4th of your canvas.  Keeping this light and bright would have made a merrier composition, which this fights to become.  7 for all the goodness that is displayed in this melodic piece.', '2005-10-21 11:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800928, 246088, 42171, '<td valign="top">That''s lovely, though why is the reflection of the light up house half sharp and half blurred? Still, the contrast is great!</td>', 'That''s lovely, though why is the reflection of the light up house half sharp and half blurred? Still, the contrast is great!', '2005-10-21 11:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800929, 246442, 42171, '<td valign="top">A Woody is an automatic 10 right?<br/> <br/>Seriously though - I like it. 8</td>', 'A Woody is an automatic 10 right? Seriously though - I like it. 8', '2005-10-21 11:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800930, 246212, 30817, '<td valign="top">Without the mysteryboat this would have been perfect.  As is, it is a moody, deep, thinkers shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'Without the mysteryboat this would have been perfect.  As is, it is a moody, deep, thinkers shot.  Nice work.', '2005-10-21 11:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800931, 243490, 14414, '<td valign="top">i like the simplicity of this and the cool tones</td>', 'i like the simplicity of this and the cool tones', '2005-10-21 11:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800933, 245577, 42171, '<td valign="top">I think this may be "Refraction" not "Reflection"... Looks cosy though!</td>', 'I think this may be "Refraction" not "Reflection"... Looks cosy though!', '2005-10-21 11:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800934, 245867, 27421, '<td valign="top">Horizon looks unlevel, other than that, beautiful image....6</td>', 'Horizon looks unlevel, other than that, beautiful image....6', '2005-10-21 11:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800936, 245359, 42171, '<td valign="top">Oooooh - I wanted to use my Sockets for a challenge a couple of weeks ago!<br/>Been beaten to it now!</td>', 'Oooooh - I wanted to use my Sockets for a challenge a couple of weeks ago!Been beaten to it now!', '2005-10-21 11:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800939, 243815, 42171, '<td valign="top">Oooh - Now this is a nice idea - very clever. Should do well!<br/>a 10 for me...</td>', 'Oooh - Now this is a nice idea - very clever. Should do well!a 10 for me...', '2005-10-21 11:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800941, 246433, 30817, '<td valign="top">More reflection, less block wall .... a 9.  As is, a 7.  Yes, it makes that much of a difference.  My own general common sense rule of thumb as to which gets dominance in a water reflection shot - the actual subject or the reflection - hinges on which stirs the deeper emotions.  In this case, the paintinglike water scene is so much more appealing than the reality of the concrete blocks.  Also, including the tip of the building in the bottom of the frame would have completed the linear congruity many viewers want to find in order to "complete" the composition.</td>', 'More reflection, less block wall .... a 9.  As is, a 7.  Yes, it makes that much of a difference.  My own general common sense rule of thumb as to which gets dominance in a water reflection shot - the actual subject or the reflection - hinges on which stirs the deeper emotions.  In this case, the paintinglike water scene is so much more appealing than the reality of the concrete blocks.  Also, including the tip of the building in the bottom of the frame would have completed the linear congruity many viewers want to find in order to "complete" the composition.', '2005-10-21 11:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800943, 245500, 42171, '<td valign="top">Nice - Interesting...</td>', 'Nice - Interesting...', '2005-10-21 11:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800944, 246263, 42171, '<td valign="top">Very crisp</td>', 'Very crisp', '2005-10-21 11:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800946, 245959, 30817, '<td valign="top">The theme of splashing colors and double reflections make this piece almost laugh at the viewer in joy!  Wonderful work here.</td>', 'The theme of splashing colors and double reflections make this piece almost laugh at the viewer in joy!  Wonderful work here.', '2005-10-21 11:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800949, 244616, 42171, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - looks damn cold!</td>', 'Nice shot - looks damn cold!', '2005-10-21 11:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800950, 245923, 30817, '<td valign="top">A very graphically appealing shot.  This is marketable.  You have even left room for the text.  If you, I would shop this to Fisher Price.  Couldn''t hurt. 8</td>', 'A very graphically appealing shot.  This is marketable.  You have even left room for the text.  If you, I would shop this to Fisher Price.  Couldn''t hurt. 8', '2005-10-21 12:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800951, 246408, 30817, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm.  This is sublime.  The foreground rocks serve as a cradle to fock the viewer to a state of contentment.  Wonderful work! 8</td>', 'Mmmmm.  This is sublime.  The foreground rocks serve as a cradle to fock the viewer to a state of contentment.  Wonderful work! 8', '2005-10-21 12:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800979, 244005, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition. I like this one a lot.</td>', 'Very cool composition. I like this one a lot.', '2005-10-21 12:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800983, 245641, 39768, '<td valign="top">Just a preference, not necessarily a criticism. <br/> <br/>I usually like the shots that show more of the reflection than above, but this time I wanted all of the orange/yellow trees to show in both. 7</td>', 'Just a preference, not necessarily a criticism.  I usually like the shots that show more of the reflection than above, but this time I wanted all of the orange/yellow trees to show in both. 7', '2005-10-21 12:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800987, 244690, 36462, '<td valign="top">should have been cropped tighter.</td>', 'should have been cropped tighter.', '2005-10-21 12:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800999, 245865, 30817, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing elements at work on this canvas. It almost seems as though the vertical pair on the far left are a bit overpoweringly predictable to this subtle beauty. I wonder if this would become a more sublimely cohesive composition with them cropped out; just leaving the white diagonal leading in from the left border. The yellow at the bottom is so very rich in texture and tone!  8</td>', 'Very pleasing elements at work on this canvas. It almost seems as though the vertical pair on the far left are a bit overpoweringly predictable to this subtle beauty. I wonder if this would become a more sublimely cohesive composition with them cropped out; just leaving the white diagonal leading in from the left border. The yellow at the bottom is so very rich in texture and tone!  8', '2005-10-21 12:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801001, 246088, 30817, '<td valign="top">Nice and moody piece. Tough exposure to get right.  You did a good job.</td>', 'Nice and moody piece. Tough exposure to get right.  You did a good job.', '2005-10-21 12:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801004, 246018, 36462, '<td valign="top">focus seems off.</td>', 'focus seems off.', '2005-10-21 12:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801008, 243505, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of Cleveland. I like the colors and the gulls looking at the reflection.  Good luck hope it does well.</td>', 'Nice shot of Cleveland. I like the colors and the gulls looking at the reflection.  Good luck hope it does well.', '2005-10-21 12:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801009, 245254, 30817, '<td valign="top">An organic element included in the frame would have finished this composition very nicely. Love the combination of broken and unbroken lines and those fine muted colors.</td>', 'An organic element included in the frame would have finished this composition very nicely. Love the combination of broken and unbroken lines and those fine muted colors.', '2005-10-21 12:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801012, 245323, 30817, '<td valign="top">Very poetic scene.  I could see this as an illustration in a book.</td>', 'Very poetic scene.  I could see this as an illustration in a book.', '2005-10-21 12:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801022, 244959, 31443, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lady and I''m glad you didn''t hide any lines, full house from me :)</td>', 'Beautiful lady and I''m glad you didn''t hide any lines, full house from me :)', '2005-10-21 12:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801026, 243967, 30817, '<td valign="top">I like the "V" effect of the pond.  You could have played that up a little more by panning to the right about 5 more degrees.  I also like that your two subjects are aligned in the frame.  That white ruler or piece of paper takes away from the overall composition.  It is small details like that which separate winning photgraphs from the others. 7</td>', 'I like the "V" effect of the pond.  You could have played that up a little more by panning to the right about 5 more degrees.  I also like that your two subjects are aligned in the frame.  That white ruler or piece of paper takes away from the overall composition.  It is small details like that which separate winning photgraphs from the others. 7', '2005-10-21 12:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801044, 244683, 30817, '<td valign="top">... and a tree and a sky.  This would have had more punch had you filled the frame with your subject. The lines on the windows and those being reflected along with the colors within the reflection are just terrific!  Those outside elements do nothing to strengthen the canvas.</td>', '... and a tree and a sky.  This would have had more punch had you filled the frame with your subject. The lines on the windows and those being reflected along with the colors within the reflection are just terrific!  Those outside elements do nothing to strengthen the canvas.', '2005-10-21 13:06:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1801050, 244611, 30817, '<td valign="top">Motion and energy are working well in this composition.  You have put movement into a static frame. In this case, splitting the frame nearly in half is appropriate because of the equal strength of the top and bottom and the arrow-like effect realized with this crop.</td>', 'Motion and energy are working well in this composition.  You have put movement into a static frame. In this case, splitting the frame nearly in half is appropriate because of the equal strength of the top and bottom and the arrow-like effect realized with this crop.', '2005-10-21 13:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801061, 246260, 30817, '<td valign="top">Terrifically expressive tones, colors and lines make this a visual feast. One more strong floating element would have made this perfect.</td>', 'Terrifically expressive tones, colors and lines make this a visual feast. One more strong floating element would have made this perfect.', '2005-10-21 13:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801063, 244682, 30817, '<td valign="top">The busy, catawaller frame fits the subject perfectly!  Good scene interpretation.</td>', 'The busy, catawaller frame fits the subject perfectly!  Good scene interpretation.', '2005-10-21 13:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801070, 246263, 38234, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2005-10-21 13:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801080, 245854, 35741, '<td valign="top">A nice idea to crop out the boats. But would it be even better if the photo would turn up side down? I think it would. But I like the photo when it is like this, too.</td>', 'A nice idea to crop out the boats. But would it be even better if the photo would turn up side down? I think it would. But I like the photo when it is like this, too.', '2005-10-21 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801087, 245361, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is a neat idea and the three palms are pretty.  (Aren''t they part of a poster?) But the skin tones are washed out.  Perhaps this would have worked better in B&amp;W.  Your photo theme would have remained the same and the viewer could have filled in the color as needed.</td>', 'This is a neat idea and the three palms are pretty.  (Aren''t they part of a poster?) But the skin tones are washed out.  Perhaps this would have worked better in B&W.  Your photo theme would have remained the same and the viewer could have filled in the color as needed.', '2005-10-21 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801094, 246409, 39560, '<td valign="top">I realize how much effort went into this photo. Most people will look at it and say it''s OOF bla bla bla. I''ll give it a 6<br/></td>', 'I realize how much effort went into this photo. Most people will look at it and say it''s OOF bla bla bla. I''ll give it a 6', '2005-10-21 13:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801097, 246287, 35741, '<td valign="top">This is a great view with great clouds but I think the time of photographing could have been better. The eye catches first the opposite bank but it is totally in shadow.</td>', 'This is a great view with great clouds but I think the time of photographing could have been better. The eye catches first the opposite bank but it is totally in shadow.', '2005-10-21 13:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801101, 244987, 30817, '<td valign="top">You could have cropped the right border to just at the end of that last arch as far as I am concerned and had a darn nice composition of repetitive arcs interspersed with subtle warm color. The two additional pairs (actual and reflection) of square shapes at the current far right throw this entire composition off balance.</td>', 'You could have cropped the right border to just at the end of that last arch as far as I am concerned and had a darn nice composition of repetitive arcs interspersed with subtle warm color. The two additional pairs (actual and reflection) of square shapes at the current far right throw this entire composition off balance.', '2005-10-21 13:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801103, 244320, 35741, '<td valign="top">A fine photo with succesful composition but I think the pic is in wrong competition. The leaf is the main thing, not a reflection.</td>', 'A fine photo with succesful composition but I think the pic is in wrong competition. The leaf is the main thing, not a reflection.', '2005-10-21 13:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801111, 245721, 30817, '<td valign="top">Pretty, predictable, patterned ....... should do well.</td>', 'Pretty, predictable, patterned ....... should do well.', '2005-10-21 13:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801112, 245923, 17065, '<td valign="top">Aww... well done. For some reason I think I would have liked to see the baby-watcher and the dark area to the left to switch places. But it is a great pic</td>', 'Aww... well done. For some reason I think I would have liked to see the baby-watcher and the dark area to the left to switch places. But it is a great pic', '2005-10-21 13:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801113, 246037, 30817, '<td valign="top">Brave enough to go against the grain.  I applaud your photography.</td>', 'Brave enough to go against the grain.  I applaud your photography.', '2005-10-21 13:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801116, 243677, 30817, '<td valign="top">I have seen more than a few shots of this style in this challenge.  this is one of the best!  8</td>', 'I have seen more than a few shots of this style in this challenge.  this is one of the best!  8', '2005-10-21 13:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801119, 245951, 30817, '<td valign="top">| like the idea of reflection as a posture.  This carries a credible mood with it.  6</td>', '| like the idea of reflection as a posture.  This carries a credible mood with it.  6', '2005-10-21 13:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801122, 245934, 30817, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I seriously think it might work better upside down.</td>', 'I like it, but I seriously think it might work better upside down.', '2005-10-21 13:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801126, 244882, 30817, '<td valign="top">the amazing leviatating glass!  Fine work.</td>', 'the amazing leviatating glass!  Fine work.', '2005-10-21 13:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801131, 245577, 30817, '<td valign="top">So much for the fireplace .... what about the wine?  JK.  Good idea and a real nice shot.  7</td>', 'So much for the fireplace .... what about the wine?  JK.  Good idea and a real nice shot.  7', '2005-10-21 13:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801135, 245361, 17065, '<td valign="top">I started out with envy of the scenery. Until I saw what seems to be the corner of a monitor in the lower left of the reflection.  ;-)  If it is a window I am still jealous, otherwise the photo still made me stop and wonder about it. Which is good, I suppose. <br/>The photo seems somewhat grainy, which is probably due to a high ISO. <br/></td>', 'I started out with envy of the scenery. Until I saw what seems to be the corner of a monitor in the lower left of the reflection.  ;-)  If it is a window I am still jealous, otherwise the photo still made me stop and wonder about it. Which is good, I suppose. The photo seems somewhat grainy, which is probably due to a high ISO. ', '2005-10-21 13:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801142, 246027, 17065, '<td valign="top">Cool! A perfect reflection, and very nice composition. If there is something left to wish for it would be a softer, warmer lightning, btu that was presumably out of your control in this one. Nice capture. 8</td>', 'Cool! A perfect reflection, and very nice composition. If there is something left to wish for it would be a softer, warmer lightning, btu that was presumably out of your control in this one. Nice capture. 8', '2005-10-21 13:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801145, 246440, 17065, '<td valign="top">Well, I can''t really comment on this. It is way out of my league. But I thought you might appreciate that comment more than no comment. :-)  9</td>', 'Well, I can''t really comment on this. It is way out of my league. But I thought you might appreciate that comment more than no comment. :-)  9', '2005-10-21 13:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801154, 245951, 17065, '<td valign="top">If there is a reflecting surface in this picture I fail to see it, which reduce the score on this photo. Probably from others as well, since it is not obvious how this meets the challenge. <br/>I suggest to always submit your photos at the largest allowed size in order to lose as little detail as possible in the submission. Composition is good, but the image is (IMHO) too small to comment on technical details such as focus, grain, DOF etc.</td>', 'If there is a reflecting surface in this picture I fail to see it, which reduce the score on this photo. Probably from others as well, since it is not obvious how this meets the challenge. I suggest to always submit your photos at the largest allowed size in order to lose as little detail as possible in the submission. Composition is good, but the image is (IMHO) too small to comment on technical details such as focus, grain, DOF etc.', '2005-10-21 13:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801157, 245855, 17065, '<td valign="top">Wow. I have no appropriate comment, other than that. The tears and her expression look very real, and if they are your timing is awseome. If not, she is a very promising model/actor. Either way, you get full score from me on this one.</td>', 'Wow. I have no appropriate comment, other than that. The tears and her expression look very real, and if they are your timing is awseome. If not, she is a very promising model/actor. Either way, you get full score from me on this one.', '2005-10-21 14:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
