(1801346, 244400, 30817, '<td valign="top">Starting from the top there is a lot of ultra-nice stuff going on within this frame ... and then we reach the near shore curve of the lake and "too much stuff" begins. You were perfect until landing on all the broken rocks, which pulls everything that was Heavenly about this composition down to earth.  8</td>', 'Starting from the top there is a lot of ultra-nice stuff going on within this frame ... and then we reach the near shore curve of the lake and "too much stuff" begins. You were perfect until landing on all the broken rocks, which pulls everything that was Heavenly about this composition down to earth.  8', '2005-10-21 15:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1801352, 246210, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent frame that is well composed and realized.  Strong contrasts are offset by that beautiful azure blue. Those clouds mirroring the shapes and positions of the human subjects are just short of amazing!  8</td>', 'This is an excellent frame that is well composed and realized.  Strong contrasts are offset by that beautiful azure blue. Those clouds mirroring the shapes and positions of the human subjects are just short of amazing!  8', '2005-10-21 15:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
