(1802287, 246235, 30817, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Nice find!  This is extraordinary in every way.  The broken reflection ... the enigmatic splash of yellow upper right corner ... the tonal qualities of the reflected buildings that evoke the mood of bygone seasons and lives that have passed this way in time.... even the washed out shade of green... it all adds up to a perfect photograph.  I don''t give many, but you get a 10!  My top pickfor this challenge.</td>', 'Wow!  Nice find!  This is extraordinary in every way.  The broken reflection ... the enigmatic splash of yellow upper right corner ... the tonal qualities of the reflected buildings that evoke the mood of bygone seasons and lives that have passed this way in time.... even the washed out shade of green... it all adds up to a perfect photograph.  I don''t give many, but you get a 10!  My top pickfor this challenge.', '2005-10-21 22:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802291, 244358, 30817, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, an exceptional piece. Cropping up to above (or cloning out after the challenge) that gray tone in the lower left corner would tighten this sharp piece even further. It also deserves a better title, but that still does not take away from the inherent worth of this otherworldly photograph.  One of my top ten picks for this challenge.  9</td>', 'Compositionally, an exceptional piece. Cropping up to above (or cloning out after the challenge) that gray tone in the lower left corner would tighten this sharp piece even further. It also deserves a better title, but that still does not take away from the inherent worth of this otherworldly photograph.  One of my top ten picks for this challenge.  9', '2005-10-21 22:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802292, 244198, 30817, '<td valign="top">Tricky, exciting and totally imaginative photograph.  I applaud you and your vision.</td>', 'Tricky, exciting and totally imaginative photograph.  I applaud you and your vision.', '2005-10-21 22:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802298, 243490, 30817, '<td valign="top">You have created music within your frame, my friend.  The slow tonal shifts and undulating linear activity are superbly choreographed into this symphony. This was written by someone who knows composition and the relationships of light and dark to express emotion; using all their knowledge to inject a visual moment into not only my eyes, but my ears.  Thanks for your kind-heartedness.  One of my picks to ribbon.  10</td>', 'You have created music within your frame, my friend.  The slow tonal shifts and undulating linear activity are superbly choreographed into this symphony. This was written by someone who knows composition and the relationships of light and dark to express emotion; using all their knowledge to inject a visual moment into not only my eyes, but my ears.  Thanks for your kind-heartedness.  One of my picks to ribbon.  10', '2005-10-21 22:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802299, 246253, 38706, '<td valign="top">I find the colours a little dull in the foreground.</td>', 'I find the colours a little dull in the foreground.', '2005-10-21 22:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
