(1802301, 246256, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is one of the finer realized shots in this challenge.  From top to bottom, this sustains interest, rewards investigation and holds its balance throughout.  Bravo! 9. One of my top ten picks</td>', 'This is one of the finer realized shots in this challenge.  From top to bottom, this sustains interest, rewards investigation and holds its balance throughout.  Bravo! 9. One of my top ten picks', '2005-10-21 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
