(1802467, 245485, 42574, '<td valign="top">Nice full reflection of the bridge. Nice feeling of tranquility. Focus may be just a tiny bit too soft for me, but still nice.</td>', 'Nice full reflection of the bridge. Nice feeling of tranquility. Focus may be just a tiny bit too soft for me, but still nice.', '2005-10-21 23:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
