(1802636, 245965, 45414, '<td valign="top">good colours</td>', 'good colours', '2005-10-22 03:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802639, 244179, 45414, '<td valign="top">I like maccas</td>', 'I like maccas', '2005-10-22 03:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802666, 243483, 45414, '<td valign="top">Great photo, pity the camera is in clear view.</td>', 'Great photo, pity the camera is in clear view.', '2005-10-22 03:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802692, 244049, 44860, '<td valign="top">Learn how to submit a bigger photo. Nice shot, but too small to enjoy. Almost a thumbnail.</td>', 'Learn how to submit a bigger photo. Nice shot, but too small to enjoy. Almost a thumbnail.', '2005-10-22 05:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802699, 245363, 44860, '<td valign="top">Unusual frame. Seems too thick to me.</td>', 'Unusual frame. Seems too thick to me.', '2005-10-22 05:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802706, 245981, 42792, '<td valign="top">Cool indeed!  Not the usual pretty or dramatic pic but there''s something about it that is interesting.  If possible, the only thing I would have preferred was to have the reflections take up a good two thirds of the space.</td>', 'Cool indeed!  Not the usual pretty or dramatic pic but there''s something about it that is interesting.  If possible, the only thing I would have preferred was to have the reflections take up a good two thirds of the space.', '2005-10-22 06:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802708, 245969, 42792, '<td valign="top">Cool idea!</td>', 'Cool idea!', '2005-10-22 06:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802711, 246128, 42792, '<td valign="top">Very nice set-up and composition.  Never seen potatoes looking this good!</td>', 'Very nice set-up and composition.  Never seen potatoes looking this good!', '2005-10-22 06:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802712, 244353, 42792, '<td valign="top">Well-aligned giving the impression of an almost optical illusion.  Just find the light and shadow caused by the knife a bit distracting.</td>', 'Well-aligned giving the impression of an almost optical illusion.  Just find the light and shadow caused by the knife a bit distracting.', '2005-10-22 06:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802713, 245676, 42792, '<td valign="top">Looks better as a thumbnail - almost like a very pretty abstract design.</td>', 'Looks better as a thumbnail - almost like a very pretty abstract design.', '2005-10-22 06:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802715, 245965, 42792, '<td valign="top">Artistic.</td>', 'Artistic.', '2005-10-22 06:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802716, 245958, 42792, '<td valign="top">My favourite colours of Autumn.  So you got me there.  Well-executed.  Just wished the reflection was less ''ripply''.</td>', 'My favourite colours of Autumn.  So you got me there.  Well-executed.  Just wished the reflection was less ''ripply''.', '2005-10-22 06:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802717, 243784, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but looks fake.  In fact, it looks more like an illustration than a photo.</td>', 'Nice idea but looks fake.  In fact, it looks more like an illustration than a photo.', '2005-10-22 06:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802718, 244260, 42792, '<td valign="top">The shadows cast as reflections are a bit too busy.  Wondering if this could have been taken from another angle to avoid that.</td>', 'The shadows cast as reflections are a bit too busy.  Wondering if this could have been taken from another angle to avoid that.', '2005-10-22 06:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802721, 246303, 42792, '<td valign="top">Perfect symetry.  Love the idea but just too much contrast for me.  Still a 7.</td>', 'Perfect symetry.  Love the idea but just too much contrast for me.  Still a 7.', '2005-10-22 06:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802722, 246260, 42792, '<td valign="top">Like an oil painting.  Lovely.</td>', 'Like an oil painting.  Lovely.', '2005-10-22 06:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802725, 244358, 42792, '<td valign="top">Kinda like the geometric dimension conveyed in this photo.  Bumping it up.</td>', 'Kinda like the geometric dimension conveyed in this photo.  Bumping it up.', '2005-10-22 06:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802731, 245771, 42792, '<td valign="top">Like this.  Wished it was a little less blur.  The reflection of the bulb and a few other details like the seat of the girl, the arm of someone sticking out of her head, ...are quite distracting.  If the guy with the book had been in sharper focus, the distracting details won''t have mattered as much coz he would have been the main subject.</td>', 'Like this.  Wished it was a little less blur.  The reflection of the bulb and a few other details like the seat of the girl, the arm of someone sticking out of her head, ...are quite distracting.  If the guy with the book had been in sharper focus, the distracting details won''t have mattered as much coz he would have been the main subject.', '2005-10-22 06:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802758, 244959, 42792, '<td valign="top">A poignant photo - So much sad ness and hopeless emotion.  Challenge-wise, reflections without a mirror here has the most interesting facets ...   Is it a reflection on the woman''s sadness or is it her reflections on her own life.  Obviously the literal representation of visual reflections against the window pane is the least significant.  <br/> <br/>Sure got me reflecting real hard here - congratulations if that''s what you wanted to achieve!  It''s hard to really like it tho'' ... like it''s really hard to accept life with no optimism, or a future with no hope, or the dark oblivion of sleep without the certainty of waking up to light.  Wow this is the longest comment I''ve left.  7.</td>', 'A poignant photo - So much sad ness and hopeless emotion.  Challenge-wise, reflections without a mirror here has the most interesting facets ...   Is it a reflection on the woman''s sadness or is it her reflections on her own life.  Obviously the literal representation of visual reflections against the window pane is the least significant.   Sure got me reflecting real hard here - congratulations if that''s what you wanted to achieve!  It''s hard to really like it tho'' ... like it''s really hard to accept life with no optimism, or a future with no hope, or the dark oblivion of sleep without the certainty of waking up to light.  Wow this is the longest comment I''ve left.  7.', '2005-10-22 08:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802760, 243813, 42792, '<td valign="top">Wow, interesting capture.  Wouldn''t have been able to tell without the title.  Photo-wise, it''s rather ambiguous.</td>', 'Wow, interesting capture.  Wouldn''t have been able to tell without the title.  Photo-wise, it''s rather ambiguous.', '2005-10-22 08:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802763, 243858, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice dynamic angle and colours.  The lines complement the sky well.</td>', 'Nice dynamic angle and colours.  The lines complement the sky well.', '2005-10-22 08:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802766, 246157, 42792, '<td valign="top">This is interesting as there is some uncertainty about where the subjects are real and where they are merely reflections.  The continuity between the real and the reflections gives some degree of fascinating optical illusion.  What it lacks is better exposure and color contrast.  Wonder if a monochrome or duo-tone image might have been more impactful.</td>', 'This is interesting as there is some uncertainty about where the subjects are real and where they are merely reflections.  The continuity between the real and the reflections gives some degree of fascinating optical illusion.  What it lacks is better exposure and color contrast.  Wonder if a monochrome or duo-tone image might have been more impactful.', '2005-10-22 08:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802769, 246362, 42792, '<td valign="top">Quite pretty - like a painting but nothing wow abt it.</td>', 'Quite pretty - like a painting but nothing wow abt it.', '2005-10-22 08:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802771, 243836, 42792, '<td valign="top">Gave this a 6 for some interesting textures and colour tones.  But frankly I''m not sure how it projects reflections ...</td>', 'Gave this a 6 for some interesting textures and colour tones.  But frankly I''m not sure how it projects reflections ...', '2005-10-22 08:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802775, 245799, 42792, '<td valign="top">Good alignment and composition.  At first glance, it looks like one whole picture by itself.  The reflection is not obvious until the TDK sign is spotted.</td>', 'Good alignment and composition.  At first glance, it looks like one whole picture by itself.  The reflection is not obvious until the TDK sign is spotted.', '2005-10-22 08:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802777, 244568, 42792, '<td valign="top">My curiosity is sparked by this one ..</td>', 'My curiosity is sparked by this one ..', '2005-10-22 08:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802779, 245937, 42792, '<td valign="top">Too small to have impact.  Would have liked to see it in more detail.</td>', 'Too small to have impact.  Would have liked to see it in more detail.', '2005-10-22 08:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802780, 245959, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice but looks like it''s been overly-tweaked on saturation.</td>', 'Nice but looks like it''s been overly-tweaked on saturation.', '2005-10-22 08:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802781, 245856, 42792, '<td valign="top">Wished this had been  bigger.  Good potential on this one.  Like how the rain (I think) has cast interesting textures on the reflection of the lights.  6 at least.</td>', 'Wished this had been  bigger.  Good potential on this one.  Like how the rain (I think) has cast interesting textures on the reflection of the lights.  6 at least.', '2005-10-22 08:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802784, 244049, 42792, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling the size doesn''t do this photo justice.  Go to the tutorials to learn how to get it to optimized size for DPC.</td>', 'I get the feeling the size doesn''t do this photo justice.  Go to the tutorials to learn how to get it to optimized size for DPC.', '2005-10-22 08:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802785, 244927, 42792, '<td valign="top">The blue looks overly saturated and there''s no real focus of interest in this image.</td>', 'The blue looks overly saturated and there''s no real focus of interest in this image.', '2005-10-22 08:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802788, 244395, 42792, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture.  Can''t find any fault overall.  Only problem is it feels like déja vu.  7.</td>', 'Very pretty picture.  Can''t find any fault overall.  Only problem is it feels like déja vu.  7.', '2005-10-22 09:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802791, 245319, 42792, '<td valign="top">Don''t know why it''s "dumbo" but this shot holds a lot of character.  There could be so many things to pick on but they seem unimportant here.  I think I like it so much because the composition comes more from the eye being able to make an existing environment interesting rather than a deliberate set-up.  An 8 for me.</td>', 'Don''t know why it''s "dumbo" but this shot holds a lot of character.  There could be so many things to pick on but they seem unimportant here.  I think I like it so much because the composition comes more from the eye being able to make an existing environment interesting rather than a deliberate set-up.  An 8 for me.', '2005-10-22 09:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802803, 243815, 42792, '<td valign="top">After skyscrapers, lakes and autumn leaves, this makes for a real refreshing interpretation.  Very nicely done.  8.</td>', 'After skyscrapers, lakes and autumn leaves, this makes for a real refreshing interpretation.  Very nicely done.  8.', '2005-10-22 09:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802804, 244379, 14414, '<td valign="top">as i''m sure others have pointed out, challenge title is reflections WITHOUT mirrors</td>', 'as i''m sure others have pointed out, challenge title is reflections WITHOUT mirrors', '2005-10-22 09:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802807, 246423, 42792, '<td valign="top">Novel idea that makes it stand out.  Well-executed too.</td>', 'Novel idea that makes it stand out.  Well-executed too.', '2005-10-22 09:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802816, 246425, 39057, '<td valign="top">I get the idea...however, even though the truck is "sort of" old looking, I wish it wasn''t there...</td>', 'I get the idea...however, even though the truck is "sort of" old looking, I wish it wasn''t there...', '2005-10-22 09:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802824, 244977, 39057, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like "washed out" sky. (I wash them out all the time!), I don''t mind this washed out sky because:<br/> <br/>Even though it is washed out, the reflection shows me what the sky really looked like. So...to me this reflection is not just a "reflection" for the challenge''s sake but is actually a "usefull" and necessary part of the story of this photograph. If it was an accident then fine...if you did it on purpose then u r da man...or ahhh da  Wo--Man!  9</td>', 'I usually don''t like "washed out" sky. (I wash them out all the time!), I don''t mind this washed out sky because: Even though it is washed out, the reflection shows me what the sky really looked like. So...to me this reflection is not just a "reflection" for the challenge''s sake but is actually a "usefull" and necessary part of the story of this photograph. If it was an accident then fine...if you did it on purpose then u r da man...or ahhh da  Wo--Man!  9', '2005-10-22 09:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802826, 244078, 39057, '<td valign="top">Almost the perfect photo....9</td>', 'Almost the perfect photo....9', '2005-10-22 09:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
