(1803580, 245851, 41047, '<td valign="top">i liked the expression on her face. the background looks blown-up and IMO the resolution could have been better.</td>', 'i liked the expression on her face. the background looks blown-up and IMO the resolution could have been better.', '2005-10-22 18:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
