(1803598, 244379, 36231, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that this is two different people, a younger man and an older man. Hopefully, most people are looking past the fact that you have a frame and it''s not really a mirror. To have the younger man more clearly in the photo, to emphasize that it''s not a true mirror, may have worked a little better. As it is, I really like it. Good luck.</td>', 'I''m guessing that this is two different people, a younger man and an older man. Hopefully, most people are looking past the fact that you have a frame and it''s not really a mirror. To have the younger man more clearly in the photo, to emphasize that it''s not a true mirror, may have worked a little better. As it is, I really like it. Good luck.', '2005-10-22 18:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803614, 246409, 41047, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but lacks contrast and sharpness.</td>', 'nice idea, but lacks contrast and sharpness.', '2005-10-22 19:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803616, 246235, 41047, '<td valign="top">this looks too bright and blown out.</td>', 'this looks too bright and blown out.', '2005-10-22 19:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803618, 244353, 16148, '<td valign="top">Really nice set up and execution.  My pick for the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'Really nice set up and execution.  My pick for the challenge.  Good luck!', '2005-10-22 19:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803620, 245493, 41047, '<td valign="top">i wonder what this really is??</td>', 'i wonder what this really is??', '2005-10-22 19:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803624, 245738, 41047, '<td valign="top">and this really goes well with reflections?</td>', 'and this really goes well with reflections?', '2005-10-22 19:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803625, 245596, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice find and well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice find and well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-22 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803630, 246449, 46330, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but I''d suggest using a larger aperture to limit the DOF.  The background distracts from the main subject of the grill.</td>', 'I like the composition but I''d suggest using a larger aperture to limit the DOF.  The background distracts from the main subject of the grill.', '2005-10-22 19:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803641, 246435, 36231, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see it right side up.  Although this is interesting, the ripples are distracting, and I think it would be better to use the same crop but right side up. Good luck!</td>', 'I''d like to see it right side up.  Although this is interesting, the ripples are distracting, and I think it would be better to use the same crop but right side up. Good luck!', '2005-10-22 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803651, 245186, 36231, '<td valign="top">This would definitely be a high scorer, but you should utilize all 640 pixels you are allowed to use. Good luck!</td>', 'This would definitely be a high scorer, but you should utilize all 640 pixels you are allowed to use. Good luck!', '2005-10-22 19:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803683, 246212, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like the tone of this image; the leading line of the metal rail is good, so is the whole composition and I like where you placed the dof..well done.</td>', 'I like the tone of this image; the leading line of the metal rail is good, so is the whole composition and I like where you placed the dof..well done.', '2005-10-22 19:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
