(1804388, 244928, 24981, '<td valign="top">Here''s an example of one of the problems I have with my point-and-shooter. Exposing for the sky often leaves the foreground too dark, while exposing for the foreground blows out the sky. In this case, I would have opted for the latter and aimed a bit lower to focus more on the reflection than the sky.</td>', 'Here''s an example of one of the problems I have with my point-and-shooter. Exposing for the sky often leaves the foreground too dark, while exposing for the foreground blows out the sky. In this case, I would have opted for the latter and aimed a bit lower to focus more on the reflection than the sky.', '2005-10-23 02:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804390, 244179, 24981, '<td valign="top">ok, it is definitely a reflection without mirrors, so it meets the challenge. Unfortunately, it''s just not a very interesting photograph. Sorry!</td>', 'ok, it is definitely a reflection without mirrors, so it meets the challenge. Unfortunately, it''s just not a very interesting photograph. Sorry!', '2005-10-23 02:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
