(1804608, 244224, 44951, '<td valign="top">You had to have this one timed just right.  Many who have not been at an air show may not know how difficult this one is.  You could be trying just to get this one and miss--great job</td>', 'You had to have this one timed just right.  Many who have not been at an air show may not know how difficult this one is.  You could be trying just to get this one and miss--great job', '2005-10-23 09:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
