(1804623, 244451, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.  Very nice title.  I''d be curious to know what color the orriginal image being reflected is.  It has an blue ting you wouldn''t want for a direct photo but enhances the reflection illusion.  well done.</td>', 'Very nice effect.  Very nice title.  I''d be curious to know what color the orriginal image being reflected is.  It has an blue ting you wouldn''t want for a direct photo but enhances the reflection illusion.  well done.', '2005-10-23 09:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
