(1804628, 245641, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good use of the color (nice time of year for the challenge).  The slightly cloudy reflected sky give it a nice "chill in the air" feel that I don''t think you would have gotten with a bright blue sky</td>', 'Very nice.  Good use of the color (nice time of year for the challenge).  The slightly cloudy reflected sky give it a nice "chill in the air" feel that I don''t think you would have gotten with a bright blue sky', '2005-10-23 09:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804634, 244608, 45343, '<td valign="top">A nice immage, I like the sweeping edge of the table that combines with the curve of the flame to give a nice movement.  It has a nice softness to it.</td>', 'A nice immage, I like the sweeping edge of the table that combines with the curve of the flame to give a nice movement.  It has a nice softness to it.', '2005-10-23 09:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
