(1804653, 246219, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice sceen.  It makes me want to return to my parents lake cabin.  I would be interested in how you metered for this shot and set your exposure which I consider excellent.</td>', 'Very nice sceen.  It makes me want to return to my parents lake cabin.  I would be interested in how you metered for this shot and set your exposure which I consider excellent.', '2005-10-23 09:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
