(1804658, 245508, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic composition.   It is a very dark image (which I like in this case).  Did you make any outake variations with a larger DoF to bring the tree line into focus?  Congradulations on this image.</td>', 'Very dramatic composition.   It is a very dark image (which I like in this case).  Did you make any outake variations with a larger DoF to bring the tree line into focus?  Congradulations on this image.', '2005-10-23 10:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804660, 244488, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice selection.  I particularly like the redundant reflection of the sky/landscape on the top, bottom, and in each vertical bar.  You did a good job staying out of the image (which probably wasn''t easy).   I wish the chrome had been a little cleaner or better polished.</td>', 'Very nice selection.  I particularly like the redundant reflection of the sky/landscape on the top, bottom, and in each vertical bar.  You did a good job staying out of the image (which probably wasn''t easy).   I wish the chrome had been a little cleaner or better polished.', '2005-10-23 10:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804662, 246387, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  has a painting feel to it.  It has a bit of digital noise in the shadows which is harder to remove with the editing constraints of the challenge.   Composition wise, I think I would have like the horizon a bit lower to cut the frame into 1/3 and 2/3.  Love your colors.</td>', 'Very nice image.  has a painting feel to it.  It has a bit of digital noise in the shadows which is harder to remove with the editing constraints of the challenge.   Composition wise, I think I would have like the horizon a bit lower to cut the frame into 1/3 and 2/3.  Love your colors.', '2005-10-23 10:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804667, 245604, 40344, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the mood of the day,lovely.</td>', 'You''ve captured the mood of the day,lovely.', '2005-10-23 10:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
