(1804904, 246283, 27207, '<td valign="top">It is quite a cool photo but I get a feeling that the picture is slightly tilted towards the left</td>', 'It is quite a cool photo but I get a feeling that the picture is slightly tilted towards the left', '2005-10-23 13:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804906, 245261, 27207, '<td valign="top">The picture is quite good especially the smooth water...in this kind of picture you could get better results by underexposing by 2 stops...secondly you can isolate the building on the right in a vertical format and get a better picture</td>', 'The picture is quite good especially the smooth water...in this kind of picture you could get better results by underexposing by 2 stops...secondly you can isolate the building on the right in a vertical format and get a better picture', '2005-10-23 13:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804913, 246050, 34013, '<td valign="top">great contrast</td>', 'great contrast', '2005-10-23 13:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804927, 246212, 39821, '<td valign="top">Better than a painting.  Nice tones and focal point.  Swans were right on cue....How''dja manage that?</td>', 'Better than a painting.  Nice tones and focal point.  Swans were right on cue....How''dja manage that?', '2005-10-23 13:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804930, 244400, 27207, '<td valign="top">Good picture,...could have been better if you move foward few steps and sit down...the brown line between the mountains and the lake would be reduced</td>', 'Good picture,...could have been better if you move foward few steps and sit down...the brown line between the mountains and the lake would be reduced', '2005-10-23 13:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804933, 243463, 27207, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture .with dramatic lighting and pure colors ..i donot know how but it could have been improved to a great picture..maybe through another angle and composition</td>', 'Excellent picture .with dramatic lighting and pure colors ..i donot know how but it could have been improved to a great picture..maybe through another angle and composition', '2005-10-23 13:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804935, 245358, 39821, '<td valign="top">This really appeals to me.  I like the near and far aspect.</td>', 'This really appeals to me.  I like the near and far aspect.', '2005-10-23 13:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804953, 244154, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great shot....wonderfully done  - love the black and white and the sharp focus - excellent imagery.</td>', 'Great shot....wonderfully done  - love the black and white and the sharp focus - excellent imagery.', '2005-10-23 13:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804954, 243663, 40977, '<td valign="top">Simple and fantastic.  Great job!!!! --8--</td>', 'Simple and fantastic.  Great job!!!! --8--', '2005-10-23 13:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804958, 245538, 20075, '<td valign="top">I think the photo would be even better (and fit the challenge better, perhaps), if the reflection was even more pronounced.  I''m not sure how this would be achieved, though.</td>', 'I think the photo would be even better (and fit the challenge better, perhaps), if the reflection was even more pronounced.  I''m not sure how this would be achieved, though.', '2005-10-23 14:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804959, 244260, 40977, '<td valign="top">Almost a mechanical version of  the birth of venus.  Very cool love the imagery and spot on focus.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Almost a mechanical version of  the birth of venus.  Very cool love the imagery and spot on focus.  Nicely done.', '2005-10-23 14:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804960, 245799, 20075, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo - I think it would do a lot better in a different challenge, though.  I''m missing the reflection here.</td>', 'Very nice photo - I think it would do a lot better in a different challenge, though.  I''m missing the reflection here.', '2005-10-23 14:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804961, 246125, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great shot ... love the blues. It might be the resolution on my screen but it seems to be a bit oversharpened....again could be my resolution ---nicely done --7--</td>', 'Great shot ... love the blues. It might be the resolution on my screen but it seems to be a bit oversharpened....again could be my resolution ---nicely done --7--', '2005-10-23 14:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804963, 244882, 40977, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  Great focus and well done --7--</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  Great focus and well done --7--', '2005-10-23 14:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804965, 246049, 20075, '<td valign="top">I really love the crispness in this photo - terrific depth of field.<br/> <br/>I only wish the reflection were clearer, but I can see that the ripples are caused by wind, not anything that you had control over.  So it may not be possible to improve much on this shot.<br/> <br/>Nice work!</td>', 'I really love the crispness in this photo - terrific depth of field. I only wish the reflection were clearer, but I can see that the ripples are caused by wind, not anything that you had control over.  So it may not be possible to improve much on this shot. Nice work!', '2005-10-23 14:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804966, 246452, 40977, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Lke how you went with black and white imagery yet let the "colors" stay crisp and clear (without desat or going b/w while editing)  Very cool shot love the reflections. --8--</td>', 'Very cool.  Lke how you went with black and white imagery yet let the "colors" stay crisp and clear (without desat or going b/w while editing)  Very cool shot love the reflections. --8--', '2005-10-23 14:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804967, 244779, 44157, '<td valign="top">nice car</td>', 'nice car', '2005-10-23 14:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804971, 245152, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great vantage point and angle for this shot.  I think you really captured the image wonderfully.  Well done --8--</td>', 'Great vantage point and angle for this shot.  I think you really captured the image wonderfully.  Well done --8--', '2005-10-23 14:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804977, 244892, 45197, '<td valign="top">that''s a shadow... not a reflection</td>', 'that''s a shadow... not a reflection', '2005-10-23 14:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804981, 244041, 20075, '<td valign="top">I''m stumped as to what this is (perhaps it would have been a good entry in the "What!?" challenge :)<br/> <br/>But, it does have a nice reflection in it.  I think it would be improved if it were sharper, and maybe cropping/composing differently, but since I don''t know what this is, it''s a little hard for me to say.</td>', 'I''m stumped as to what this is (perhaps it would have been a good entry in the "What!?" challenge :) But, it does have a nice reflection in it.  I think it would be improved if it were sharper, and maybe cropping/composing differently, but since I don''t know what this is, it''s a little hard for me to say.', '2005-10-23 14:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804984, 246252, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very good image, makes me feel a bit Troll-ish.  Very interesting sky (which makes me want to see more of it).  Over-all a bit dark, but I think that was the look you were going for.   Nice.</td>', 'Very good image, makes me feel a bit Troll-ish.  Very interesting sky (which makes me want to see more of it).  Over-all a bit dark, but I think that was the look you were going for.   Nice.', '2005-10-23 14:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804986, 245476, 45343, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  I like how you arranged and cropped this with the positioning of the subject, reflection and horizon.</td>', 'Nice subject.  I like how you arranged and cropped this with the positioning of the subject, reflection and horizon.', '2005-10-23 14:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804990, 243967, 20075, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I think it would be even better if the photo was really crisp throughout (not sure in this case if in needs an increased depth of field or use of a tripod). There''s just something ever so slightly fuzzy about the photo.<br/> <br/>Other than that, perhaps finding a way to better integrate the little boy''s "reflections" on the flower in the rest of the photo - perhaps by getting him to be a little larger in the frame.  Not quite sure if this would work - just a suggestion.</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I think it would be even better if the photo was really crisp throughout (not sure in this case if in needs an increased depth of field or use of a tripod). There''s just something ever so slightly fuzzy about the photo. Other than that, perhaps finding a way to better integrate the little boy''s "reflections" on the flower in the rest of the photo - perhaps by getting him to be a little larger in the frame.  Not quite sure if this would work - just a suggestion.', '2005-10-23 14:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1804995, 244878, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very colorful.  I like the off centering position.</td>', 'Very colorful.  I like the off centering position.', '2005-10-23 14:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805000, 244155, 45343, '<td valign="top">A very creative Idea.  One of the most orriginal in the challenge.</td>', 'A very creative Idea.  One of the most orriginal in the challenge.', '2005-10-23 14:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805006, 245937, 45343, '<td valign="top">A very nice subject.  Also, a striking sky both in and out of your reflection.  Several people will probably comment that it is too small.  Check the tutorials for tips on sizing.  Good picture.</td>', 'A very nice subject.  Also, a striking sky both in and out of your reflection.  Several people will probably comment that it is too small.  Check the tutorials for tips on sizing.  Good picture.', '2005-10-23 14:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805011, 244975, 45343, '<td valign="top">Heheh.   Very cute.   Nice colors and contrast too.  Probably a very patient model/helper.   Happy Halloween.</td>', 'Heheh.   Very cute.   Nice colors and contrast too.  Probably a very patient model/helper.   Happy Halloween.', '2005-10-23 14:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805015, 246140, 45343, '<td valign="top">I like the siplicity of this picture and the illusion of depth.</td>', 'I like the siplicity of this picture and the illusion of depth.', '2005-10-23 14:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805019, 244293, 45343, '<td valign="top">What a friendly fellow.   Nice image and well croped.  I like the touch the thin black boarder gives to go along with the darkness of the bird. Good use of color too.</td>', 'What a friendly fellow.   Nice image and well croped.  I like the touch the thin black boarder gives to go along with the darkness of the bird. Good use of color too.', '2005-10-23 14:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805020, 244395, 25742, '<td valign="top">beautiful light and good comp.</td>', 'beautiful light and good comp.', '2005-10-23 14:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805022, 243745, 45343, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if your title was ment to be a pun... but it was funny.  clever picture.</td>', 'I''m not sure if your title was ment to be a pun... but it was funny.  clever picture.', '2005-10-23 14:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805023, 243815, 45343, '<td valign="top">colorful... I like the flow from one cd to the next.</td>', 'colorful... I like the flow from one cd to the next.', '2005-10-23 14:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805024, 244393, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  A good selection is subject, well set up and captured.</td>', 'Very nice picture.  A good selection is subject, well set up and captured.', '2005-10-23 14:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805028, 245969, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very funny.  Hey!  I know that bird!  One of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Very funny.  Hey!  I know that bird!  One of my favorites in the challenge.', '2005-10-23 14:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805037, 245965, 45343, '<td valign="top">A very nice image... colorful with a real pop to it.  Well done.</td>', 'A very nice image... colorful with a real pop to it.  Well done.', '2005-10-23 15:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805048, 246171, 45343, '<td valign="top">Good concept with a good choice in reflective surfaces.  Clever.   Unfortunately, the surface is also reflecting some distracting light back up into the subjects.  Diffusing the light source and adding a black backdrop would add a little drama to this well conceived photo.  BTW, nice family.</td>', 'Good concept with a good choice in reflective surfaces.  Clever.   Unfortunately, the surface is also reflecting some distracting light back up into the subjects.  Diffusing the light source and adding a black backdrop would add a little drama to this well conceived photo.  BTW, nice family.', '2005-10-23 15:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805055, 244154, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very good idea and well made.   The good DoF to help the reflected couple less in focus aids in the memory illusion you have created.  In addition, the couple is nicely and softly lit.  The shadow on the window frame makes the lighting look harsher then it would have looked otherwise.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Very good idea and well made.   The good DoF to help the reflected couple less in focus aids in the memory illusion you have created.  In addition, the couple is nicely and softly lit.  The shadow on the window frame makes the lighting look harsher then it would have looked otherwise.  One of my favorites.', '2005-10-23 15:14:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1805056, 246136, 45343, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast and composition of this photo.  Very nice.</td>', 'I like the contrast and composition of this photo.  Very nice.', '2005-10-23 15:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805102, 245370, 40977, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fun shot....how confusing it must all seem to a child.  I like the reflection and the focus is good. A little more pop to the colors a maybe a bit tighter shot/crop would have really brought the image in for me. Nevertheless a nice job --6--</td>', 'Looks like a fun shot....how confusing it must all seem to a child.  I like the reflection and the focus is good. A little more pop to the colors a maybe a bit tighter shot/crop would have really brought the image in for me. Nevertheless a nice job --6--', '2005-10-23 15:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805103, 246302, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great reflection - wonderful colors and contrast --- spot on focus  Nicely Done</td>', 'Great reflection - wonderful colors and contrast --- spot on focus  Nicely Done', '2005-10-23 15:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805106, 244690, 40977, '<td valign="top">A like the reflection, but the microwave is so out of focus it is distracting. The border IMO also takes away from the shot.  I think the flowers are beautiful and maybe a bit more of them in the shot and less framing (microwave and border) would have helped. Appreciate that you tried something different.</td>', 'A like the reflection, but the microwave is so out of focus it is distracting. The border IMO also takes away from the shot.  I think the flowers are beautiful and maybe a bit more of them in the shot and less framing (microwave and border) would have helped. Appreciate that you tried something different.', '2005-10-23 15:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805107, 246013, 40977, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2005-10-23 15:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805115, 246389, 45343, '<td valign="top">I always love eye pictures.   This one is a little dark... especially when there seems to be a very nice eye color.   But I understnd it had to be to get the full reflection.</td>', 'I always love eye pictures.   This one is a little dark... especially when there seems to be a very nice eye color.   But I understnd it had to be to get the full reflection.', '2005-10-23 16:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805121, 245506, 45343, '<td valign="top">Nice color and curves.  A simple subject arranged in a way to give you a lot to look at.</td>', 'Nice color and curves.  A simple subject arranged in a way to give you a lot to look at.', '2005-10-23 16:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805126, 245978, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like how you focused on the birds with the building being reflected, not showing the acutal building.  I guess what I''m trying to say is nice perspective.</td>', 'I like how you focused on the birds with the building being reflected, not showing the acutal building.  I guess what I''m trying to say is nice perspective.', '2005-10-23 16:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805127, 243993, 45343, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  I love the dynamic sky in the reflection.   I also like you horizon placement.  You will probably take a hit and get some comments from the small size so I recommend you look in the tutorials at "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges" by EddyG regarding resizing.   If you do resize it, post it in your portfolio so I can take a close look.<br/></td>', 'This is a great photo.  I love the dynamic sky in the reflection.   I also like you horizon placement.  You will probably take a hit and get some comments from the small size so I recommend you look in the tutorials at "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges" by EddyG regarding resizing.   If you do resize it, post it in your portfolio so I can take a close look.', '2005-10-23 16:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805132, 246267, 45343, '<td valign="top">Quite striking.  A great photo with good color.  If you ever get a chance, I would love to see a shot taken from closer to the water with that distant bluff and its reflection as the sole focus.  I wish I had material like this where I live.</td>', 'Quite striking.  A great photo with good color.  If you ever get a chance, I would love to see a shot taken from closer to the water with that distant bluff and its reflection as the sole focus.  I wish I had material like this where I live.', '2005-10-23 16:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805146, 244358, 45995, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, just the two eyes are out of place, otherwise nice one</td>', 'Nice photo, just the two eyes are out of place, otherwise nice one', '2005-10-23 16:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805147, 243677, 45995, '<td valign="top">Very nice, super colours.</td>', 'Very nice, super colours.', '2005-10-23 16:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805151, 244627, 45995, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, just the white light to tune down.</td>', 'Lovely shot, just the white light to tune down.', '2005-10-23 16:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805156, 244245, 45995, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but .............. some thing missing.........</td>', 'Not bad, but .............. some thing missing.........', '2005-10-23 16:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805160, 246037, 45995, '<td valign="top">Peacefull shot, love it. Nice one.</td>', 'Peacefull shot, love it. Nice one.', '2005-10-23 16:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805165, 245458, 45995, '<td valign="top">Super color. Really like it, no I love it, super composition and love the detail.</td>', 'Super color. Really like it, no I love it, super composition and love the detail.', '2005-10-23 16:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805167, 246423, 45995, '<td valign="top">Wow, super idea for a shot and loads of warm colors</td>', 'Wow, super idea for a shot and loads of warm colors', '2005-10-23 16:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805171, 245013, 45995, '<td valign="top">Nice, missing contrast. Good</td>', 'Nice, missing contrast. Good', '2005-10-23 16:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805177, 246414, 45995, '<td valign="top">Super, love this one</td>', 'Super, love this one', '2005-10-23 16:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805202, 246050, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture with extreem contrast.   I am a little confused as to the source of the scratches.  That looks like water... so, Is it your lense/filter?  To me it is a bit distracting, but I otherwise love this picture.</td>', 'Very nice picture with extreem contrast.   I am a little confused as to the source of the scratches.  That looks like water... so, Is it your lense/filter?  To me it is a bit distracting, but I otherwise love this picture.', '2005-10-23 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805213, 245040, 18073, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the composition here, although you are trying to fit in as much reflection as possible, for me the foreground is a bit boring, apart from the nice warm colour there is little in the way of interest.  Better luck next time I guess.</td>', 'Not sure about the composition here, although you are trying to fit in as much reflection as possible, for me the foreground is a bit boring, apart from the nice warm colour there is little in the way of interest.  Better luck next time I guess.', '2005-10-23 16:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805217, 244881, 18073, '<td valign="top">Quite nice, and unusual colours, it looks almost cross processed or something.  Nice detail too.</td>', 'Quite nice, and unusual colours, it looks almost cross processed or something.  Nice detail too.', '2005-10-23 16:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805219, 245903, 45343, '<td valign="top">colorful... I bet it blinds the cars driving by when the sun hits it right.  I also Like the way you framed it.</td>', 'colorful... I bet it blinds the cars driving by when the sun hits it right.  I also Like the way you framed it.', '2005-10-23 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805220, 245518, 18073, '<td valign="top">Great colour and detail here.  Love how it gets darker in the foreground.  Good luck with this one, maybe a top 10?</td>', 'Great colour and detail here.  Love how it gets darker in the foreground.  Good luck with this one, maybe a top 10?', '2005-10-23 16:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805223, 245464, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic sky... I wish the water had been calmer for you.  well done.</td>', 'Very dramatic sky... I wish the water had been calmer for you.  well done.', '2005-10-23 17:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805225, 244245, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture with good colors.   Is that a boat way down at the end?</td>', 'Very nice picture with good colors.   Is that a boat way down at the end?', '2005-10-23 17:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805228, 245596, 45343, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.   Good color.  Excelent composition.  Only thing I would change...  drive over the street lamp before you took this shot :P</td>', 'I really like this picture.   Good color.  Excelent composition.  Only thing I would change...  drive over the street lamp before you took this shot :P', '2005-10-23 17:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805232, 245940, 45343, '<td valign="top">I feel like a field mouse stairing down that throat.  :)    Nice DoF.   I am supprised you stayed out of the reflection so well.  Well done.</td>', 'I feel like a field mouse stairing down that throat.  :)    Nice DoF.   I am supprised you stayed out of the reflection so well.  Well done.', '2005-10-23 17:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805236, 243784, 45343, '<td valign="top">You should be proud of this picture.... The reflection distortion makes blends the painted portion with the real elements.  I like that alot.  I also like the natural circular framing.</td>', 'You should be proud of this picture.... The reflection distortion makes blends the painted portion with the real elements.  I like that alot.  I also like the natural circular framing.', '2005-10-23 17:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805250, 244223, 45343, '<td valign="top">I like the angles in this shot.</td>', 'I like the angles in this shot.', '2005-10-23 17:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805251, 246335, 45343, '<td valign="top">I like the differences in appearance between the two angles of view.  amazing what a difference that made.  I only wish you had cleaned the glass prior.</td>', 'I like the differences in appearance between the two angles of view.  amazing what a difference that made.  I only wish you had cleaned the glass prior.', '2005-10-23 17:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805262, 244117, 45343, '<td valign="top">This would have been good for the personification challenge.   I like this image, both its color and its playfulness.</td>', 'This would have been good for the personification challenge.   I like this image, both its color and its playfulness.', '2005-10-23 17:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805268, 244690, 45343, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, Well composed... I think I would have prefered a deaper DoF to help define the microwave a little more.   This inspires a whole host of comical variations...   Let me get my kid and my microwave, brb.</td>', 'Clever idea, Well composed... I think I would have prefered a deaper DoF to help define the microwave a little more.   This inspires a whole host of comical variations...   Let me get my kid and my microwave, brb.', '2005-10-23 17:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
