(1805427, 243790, 45343, '<td valign="top">Including the elements on top of the water helped define the reflective nature of this picture.   It was an element that was missing in several entries and made a significant impact on yours.   Well done.</td>', 'Including the elements on top of the water helped define the reflective nature of this picture.   It was an element that was missing in several entries and made a significant impact on yours.   Well done.', '2005-10-23 19:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
