(1805436, 245577, 45343, '<td valign="top">Although there is reflection on the glass base, most of this is refraction of light, rather then reflection.  Many entries did the same thing, so I''m not worrying about it.  The wine lover in me enjoys this photo.   I particularly like the hue created by the flame and the wine.   Also a nice composition.  This makes me want to go open a bottle...   so if you excuse me  :)</td>', 'Although there is reflection on the glass base, most of this is refraction of light, rather then reflection.  Many entries did the same thing, so I''m not worrying about it.  The wine lover in me enjoys this photo.   I particularly like the hue created by the flame and the wine.   Also a nice composition.  This makes me want to go open a bottle...   so if you excuse me  :)', '2005-10-23 19:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805438, 244243, 45343, '<td valign="top">I like this image... very contrasting.  The back lit leaves almost give it and Infrared feel.  The reflecting sunlight bring out the movement of the water.... I can almost hear it.  Well done.</td>', 'I like this image... very contrasting.  The back lit leaves almost give it and Infrared feel.  The reflecting sunlight bring out the movement of the water.... I can almost hear it.  Well done.', '2005-10-23 19:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
