(1805452, 245845, 45343, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this.   The redundency but difference in them would make them a great subject for several different projects.  Very nice image.</td>', 'I love the colors in this.   The redundency but difference in them would make them a great subject for several different projects.  Very nice image.', '2005-10-23 19:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
