(1805506, 246088, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice... I envy you if that is your home.  It has a nice red hue that gives it an inviting warmth.  I also like the amount of blur the lake gives the reflected cabin... not too much or too little.  Although the cloudy top is dramatic, I would have liked to see the hillside continue up.   Although it is hard to move the clouds, it almost looks like a giant wave about to crash down on the house.</td>', 'Very nice... I envy you if that is your home.  It has a nice red hue that gives it an inviting warmth.  I also like the amount of blur the lake gives the reflected cabin... not too much or too little.  Although the cloudy top is dramatic, I would have liked to see the hillside continue up.   Although it is hard to move the clouds, it almost looks like a giant wave about to crash down on the house.', '2005-10-23 19:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805523, 245503, 43329, '<td valign="top">Such a calm scene... so peaceful.</td>', 'Such a calm scene... so peaceful.', '2005-10-23 20:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805533, 244963, 45343, '<td valign="top">I like this. Nice color and composition.   I would like to know what your reflective surface is made of.  It makes me think of the newer black-glass stove tops.</td>', 'I like this. Nice color and composition.   I would like to know what your reflective surface is made of.  It makes me think of the newer black-glass stove tops.', '2005-10-23 20:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805534, 244191, 43329, '<td valign="top">Interesting blurred reflection of the dog on the flooring, but could you have made a more effective shot by changing your angle, perhaps to a closeup view of the dog''s head and by getting a sharper reflection, maybe by increasing the lighting?</td>', 'Interesting blurred reflection of the dog on the flooring, but could you have made a more effective shot by changing your angle, perhaps to a closeup view of the dog''s head and by getting a sharper reflection, maybe by increasing the lighting?', '2005-10-23 20:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805541, 245865, 43221, '<td valign="top">beautiful abstract. pleasing to the eye and provocative to the thought.</td>', 'beautiful abstract. pleasing to the eye and provocative to the thought.', '2005-10-23 20:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805553, 245251, 43221, '<td valign="top">I really wish the reflection was complete.</td>', 'I really wish the reflection was complete.', '2005-10-23 20:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
