(1805587, 245051, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s taken me a few minutes and a bit of squinting to see the store reflection. I think the reflection of the bridge is okay, but the cars are distracting for me. It also seems...filmy (for lack of better words). Compared with other entries in the challenge, it doesn''t hold my interest as well and therefore I have given it a lower score. Sorry.</td>', 'It''s taken me a few minutes and a bit of squinting to see the store reflection. I think the reflection of the bridge is okay, but the cars are distracting for me. It also seems...filmy (for lack of better words). Compared with other entries in the challenge, it doesn''t hold my interest as well and therefore I have given it a lower score. Sorry.', '2005-10-23 20:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805590, 244766, 41675, '<td valign="top">Well, for starters, I would remove the date and time from the photo. The sky isn''t too bad, but there is a spot of red on the brick reflection - guessing that''s from your camera? Interesting angle.</td>', 'Well, for starters, I would remove the date and time from the photo. The sky isn''t too bad, but there is a spot of red on the brick reflection - guessing that''s from your camera? Interesting angle.', '2005-10-23 20:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805591, 244328, 43329, '<td valign="top">Very busy photo. Unfortunately, the predominant reflections are in the 3D style graphics on the back wall and not from the ones on the wood surface in the bowling lane.</td>', 'Very busy photo. Unfortunately, the predominant reflections are in the 3D style graphics on the back wall and not from the ones on the wood surface in the bowling lane.', '2005-10-23 20:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805593, 246131, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, the only reflection I can kind of see would be on the vehicle. For me, when voting I was lloking for the reflection to be a majority of the photo or at least 50%. While you have captured a nice sunset, I have given it a lower score compared to other entries for lack of a greater reflection.</td>', 'Hmmm, the only reflection I can kind of see would be on the vehicle. For me, when voting I was lloking for the reflection to be a majority of the photo or at least 50%. While you have captured a nice sunset, I have given it a lower score compared to other entries for lack of a greater reflection.', '2005-10-23 20:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805597, 244025, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your title tells me what this is, but the overall quality of the photo is so blurred, that it''s difficult for me to ascertain the images...except the candle flame. Therefore I have given this a low score.</td>', 'Your title tells me what this is, but the overall quality of the photo is so blurred, that it''s difficult for me to ascertain the images...except the candle flame. Therefore I have given this a low score.', '2005-10-23 20:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805601, 246347, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what your title refers to. The one object in the uper right is distracting for me because it''s coloring is so different. Perhaps a bit more lighting and some level adjustments would help the overall quality. Compared with other entries however, I have chosen to give your photo a low score.</td>', 'I''m not sure what your title refers to. The one object in the uper right is distracting for me because it''s coloring is so different. Perhaps a bit more lighting and some level adjustments would help the overall quality. Compared with other entries however, I have chosen to give your photo a low score.', '2005-10-23 20:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805602, 245958, 45343, '<td valign="top">A very nice and colorful subject.  well done.</td>', 'A very nice and colorful subject.  well done.', '2005-10-23 20:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805603, 244172, 43329, '<td valign="top">Strong sentiment, but it doesn''t give me a visual reflection. <br/>Also, the girl''s profile is somewhat lost against the man''s eyebrow... perhaps the double portrait would have greater impact if the lovely shadows on the girl''s mouth were contrasted against the man''s forehead?</td>', 'Strong sentiment, but it doesn''t give me a visual reflection. Also, the girl''s profile is somewhat lost against the man''s eyebrow... perhaps the double portrait would have greater impact if the lovely shadows on the girl''s mouth were contrasted against the man''s forehead?', '2005-10-23 20:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805605, 245595, 41675, '<td valign="top">A good concept, but the colors seem a bit griany (although that may have been intentional on your part). For me, had the moon and reflection been off centered it would add more interest. Also, I wonder how this would look if you lowered your horizon to show more of the sky and thereby keeping your horizon out of the dead center photo zone also.</td>', 'A good concept, but the colors seem a bit griany (although that may have been intentional on your part). For me, had the moon and reflection been off centered it would add more interest. Also, I wonder how this would look if you lowered your horizon to show more of the sky and thereby keeping your horizon out of the dead center photo zone also.', '2005-10-23 20:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805607, 244676, 43329, '<td valign="top">Very minor reflections... perhaps the upright coin, with the same coloured reflections, against a contrasting background would give more impact?</td>', 'Very minor reflections... perhaps the upright coin, with the same coloured reflections, against a contrasting background would give more impact?', '2005-10-23 20:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805608, 245209, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not a bad concept, but for me the photo is too small. DPC allows us to use a maximum of 640 pixels. I find that having a larger photo gives the viewer/voter a better feel for your shot.</td>', 'Not a bad concept, but for me the photo is too small. DPC allows us to use a maximum of 640 pixels. I find that having a larger photo gives the viewer/voter a better feel for your shot.', '2005-10-23 20:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805609, 244928, 41200, '<td valign="top">It looks like the camera metered the exposure for the background which was very bright. And I think that caused your main subject to be underexposed. Spot metering can be a little tricky. PM me if you want &amp; I can give you a few tips on out-thinking the camera''s AI.</td>', 'It looks like the camera metered the exposure for the background which was very bright. And I think that caused your main subject to be underexposed. Spot metering can be a little tricky. PM me if you want & I can give you a few tips on out-thinking the camera''s AI.', '2005-10-23 20:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805610, 244085, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part is the actual refelection - I wish there was more of it. I also wonder how this would be if you rotated counter-clockwise so that it wasn''t tipping downward to the right?</td>', 'My favorite part is the actual refelection - I wish there was more of it. I also wonder how this would be if you rotated counter-clockwise so that it wasn''t tipping downward to the right?', '2005-10-23 20:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805611, 244381, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring. For me, it could have been a bit sharper, but I''m bumping it up a point after a second look.</td>', 'I like the coloring. For me, it could have been a bit sharper, but I''m bumping it up a point after a second look.', '2005-10-23 20:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805612, 245951, 43329, '<td valign="top">Nice image of someone deep in thought, but it doesn''t give me a visual reflection. Also, the image is very, very small. It would certainly have more impact if it were the full 640 pixels on the largest dimension, which is allowed in the regulations.</td>', 'Nice image of someone deep in thought, but it doesn''t give me a visual reflection. Also, the image is very, very small. It would certainly have more impact if it were the full 640 pixels on the largest dimension, which is allowed in the regulations.', '2005-10-23 20:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805616, 244313, 43329, '<td valign="top">Photographing dappled highlights-and-shadows and reflections together gives such a busy image. Could you have improved this image by cropping more tightly on the reflecting area?</td>', 'Photographing dappled highlights-and-shadows and reflections together gives such a busy image. Could you have improved this image by cropping more tightly on the reflecting area?', '2005-10-23 21:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805617, 244222, 41200, '<td valign="top">Cool shot &amp; great idea. Too bad there''s no spot editing on this one. Wednesday clone out the camera &amp; add it to your portfolio. Nice job!</td>', 'Cool shot & great idea. Too bad there''s no spot editing on this one. Wednesday clone out the camera & add it to your portfolio. Nice job!', '2005-10-23 21:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805618, 245013, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your concept - it shows creativity. I think with a few tweaks it could work better. For me, a bit more focus on the window reflection would make it better and I wonder how this would look in color. The black and white seems a little...flat to me. Perhaps a bit more contrast would take some of that away.</td>', 'I like your concept - it shows creativity. I think with a few tweaks it could work better. For me, a bit more focus on the window reflection would make it better and I wonder how this would look in color. The black and white seems a little...flat to me. Perhaps a bit more contrast would take some of that away.', '2005-10-23 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805621, 245916, 41675, '<td valign="top">Well, there is a refelction, but compared with other entries your subject matter doesn''t hold my interest, and the colors seems flat and dull to me.</td>', 'Well, there is a refelction, but compared with other entries your subject matter doesn''t hold my interest, and the colors seems flat and dull to me.', '2005-10-23 21:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805628, 245946, 43329, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s obviously a reflection, and yes, there''s this lovely closeup "something" contrasting on the reflecting surface. But what is it? And what''s the reference?<br/>Did this wind up in the wrong challenge?<br/></td>', 'Yes, it''s obviously a reflection, and yes, there''s this lovely closeup "something" contrasting on the reflecting surface. But what is it? And what''s the reference?Did this wind up in the wrong challenge?', '2005-10-23 21:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805629, 245186, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not bad. I think this works well as a vertical photo. I like the sky. Keep in mind that DPC allows us to have a maximum of 640 pixels - use this to your advantage to show the voters/viewers your photo. I like the colors of the sky, but the pine tree in the foreground is a bit distracting. I also wish there was more of the reflection than what is shown. Good effort.</td>', 'Not bad. I think this works well as a vertical photo. I like the sky. Keep in mind that DPC allows us to have a maximum of 640 pixels - use this to your advantage to show the voters/viewers your photo. I like the colors of the sky, but the pine tree in the foreground is a bit distracting. I also wish there was more of the reflection than what is shown. Good effort.', '2005-10-23 21:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805631, 245738, 43329, '<td valign="top">I see the live dog and the similarity in textures between the dog''s fur and the fabric of the stuffed toys, but unfortunately, this image doesn''t give me the visual reflection that I was expecting.</td>', 'I see the live dog and the similarity in textures between the dog''s fur and the fabric of the stuffed toys, but unfortunately, this image doesn''t give me the visual reflection that I was expecting.', '2005-10-23 21:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805632, 246392, 41675, '<td valign="top">An interesting building. The white highlight is a bit too much in the upper middle for me. also, I would have used either more or less of the tree in the upper left. More to frame the photo, or simply crop it out altogether. My favorite part is the upper right quadrant - nice blues.</td>', 'An interesting building. The white highlight is a bit too much in the upper middle for me. also, I would have used either more or less of the tree in the upper left. More to frame the photo, or simply crop it out altogether. My favorite part is the upper right quadrant - nice blues.', '2005-10-23 21:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805634, 245136, 41675, '<td valign="top">After going through all the photos, I realised yours was the only one I gave a 10 to. I hope you do well in the challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'After going through all the photos, I realised yours was the only one I gave a 10 to. I hope you do well in the challenge. Good luck.', '2005-10-23 21:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805638, 244198, 43329, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this is such an interesting image. But what I see here is refraction through a textured glass object, rather than reflection off the surface of the glass.<br/></td>', 'Sorry, this is such an interesting image. But what I see here is refraction through a textured glass object, rather than reflection off the surface of the glass.', '2005-10-23 21:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805639, 244668, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried to figure out what these containers(?) or machines(?) are, but that''s besides the point. :-) For me, I kind of feel I''m looking at two separate photos. One with the reflections of the two men and then further down the line there are the yellow reflections. Personally, I like the far end of your photo better and more interesting.</td>', 'I''ve tried to figure out what these containers(?) or machines(?) are, but that''s besides the point. :-) For me, I kind of feel I''m looking at two separate photos. One with the reflections of the two men and then further down the line there are the yellow reflections. Personally, I like the far end of your photo better and more interesting.', '2005-10-23 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805641, 244766, 43329, '<td valign="top">Too bad that the reflection of the near brick isn''t strong enough to overcome the highlight in the sky area.</td>', 'Too bad that the reflection of the near brick isn''t strong enough to overcome the highlight in the sky area.', '2005-10-23 21:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805642, 246414, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...well, after looking at your photo for a few minutes, I still don''t see the reflection. Good effort at an illusion, although the fingers seem to be slipping inside of the sun and not grasping around it as your title suggests. Shows creativity and I look forward to your future entries.</td>', 'Hmmm...well, after looking at your photo for a few minutes, I still don''t see the reflection. Good effort at an illusion, although the fingers seem to be slipping inside of the sun and not grasping around it as your title suggests. Shows creativity and I look forward to your future entries.', '2005-10-23 21:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1805644, 244319, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this photo would be more effective if the reflected head had not been cut off. I like the blue, but I find the dust particles on the car somewhat distracting. Sometimes I carry around a cloth to wipe down surfaces in an effort to prevent this.</td>', 'For me, this photo would be more effective if the reflected head had not been cut off. I like the blue, but I find the dust particles on the car somewhat distracting. Sometimes I carry around a cloth to wipe down surfaces in an effort to prevent this.', '2005-10-23 21:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
