(1805650, 245863, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part is actually the PSP and the background. Unfortunately my least favorite part is the reflection itself. For me, I would have liked to seen the reflection in focus and the PSP blurred, and perhaps cropped in a bit tighter too.</td>', 'My favorite part is actually the PSP and the background. Unfortunately my least favorite part is the reflection itself. For me, I would have liked to seen the reflection in focus and the PSP blurred, and perhaps cropped in a bit tighter too.', '2005-10-23 21:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
