(1806431, 243930, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, interesting picture. At first I thought it was the sky and maybe you entered the wrong one but I see it now.  Good thing I always look twice. Wonderful color, almost TOO good.</td>', 'Wow, interesting picture. At first I thought it was the sky and maybe you entered the wrong one but I see it now.  Good thing I always look twice. Wonderful color, almost TOO good.', '2005-10-24 02:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
