(1806439, 244902, 42638, '<td valign="top">What a nice place! The colors are a bit off and the sky is blown a bit but I like the reds and oranges. Very nice reflection of them too.</td>', 'What a nice place! The colors are a bit off and the sky is blown a bit but I like the reds and oranges. Very nice reflection of them too.', '2005-10-24 02:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
