(1806453, 244313, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Love all the colors here. Its a bit out of focus and levels are somewhat off. I do like the greens and orange in the water with the blue sky.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Love all the colors here. Its a bit out of focus and levels are somewhat off. I do like the greens and orange in the water with the blue sky.', '2005-10-24 02:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806455, 244676, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Great looking coins but its not very reflective. The background is a bit bright too.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Great looking coins but its not very reflective. The background is a bit bright too.', '2005-10-24 02:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806462, 246252, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, a bit dark though. Love the clouds through the bridges and their reflections. Almost mirror like.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, a bit dark though. Love the clouds through the bridges and their reflections. Almost mirror like.', '2005-10-24 02:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806464, 246022, 43437, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the wood in the water, adds depth and is more interesting.  I would have liked to see more of the water in the picture instead of the actual sky, I like the color of the sky reflection better. Nice picture.</td>', 'I love the colors and the wood in the water, adds depth and is more interesting.  I would have liked to see more of the water in the picture instead of the actual sky, I like the color of the sky reflection better. Nice picture.', '2005-10-24 02:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
