(1806665, 246206, 45784, '<td valign="top">It is very colorfull (good thing) but very confusing, no subject and unreconizable<br/>background (bad thing). Too much reflection, and we don''t know what it is for sure.<br/>Zoom out more on this kind of shots or point your camera higher to show us what is<br/>really there.</td>', 'It is very colorfull (good thing) but very confusing, no subject and unreconizablebackground (bad thing). Too much reflection, and we don''t know what it is for sure.Zoom out more on this kind of shots or point your camera higher to show us what isreally there.', '2005-10-24 03:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806666, 246423, 45784, '<td valign="top">Now this is really something!<br/>I wish I knew how you guys get this effect. Very colorfull.<br/>And a very smooth plastic fence makes this shot very neet! Congrats</td>', 'Now this is really something!I wish I knew how you guys get this effect. Very colorfull.And a very smooth plastic fence makes this shot very neet! Congrats', '2005-10-24 03:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
