(1806684, 246452, 45784, '<td valign="top">Dominos in back bug me. I don''t like the way you composed them. But I like the idea alot.<br/>The reflection is very strange, yet strong and pointed out.</td>', 'Dominos in back bug me. I don''t like the way you composed them. But I like the idea alot.The reflection is very strange, yet strong and pointed out.', '2005-10-24 04:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
