(1808229, 244568, 45784, '<td valign="top">You have some color problems. And the idea is so not original. But I have to say, this is<br/>really great reflection. Almost like it wasn''t watter</td>', 'You have some color problems. And the idea is so not original. But I have to say, this isreally great reflection. Almost like it wasn''t watter', '2005-10-24 18:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
