(1808244, 244629, 45784, '<td valign="top">But why centered. I DOES bug me when I come to think about the composition.<br/>I agree that rule of thirds should be just a guideline, not a rule, but I belive it would<br/>fit in here perfectly. But color is very powerfull and a subject very nice and pleasing<br/>to look at.</td>', 'But why centered. I DOES bug me when I come to think about the composition.I agree that rule of thirds should be just a guideline, not a rule, but I belive it wouldfit in here perfectly. But color is very powerfull and a subject very nice and pleasingto look at.', '2005-10-24 18:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
