(1808292, 246184, 45784, '<td valign="top">If there wasn''t for blown out sky I''d vote oure 10. The problem with landscape<br/>photography is that you don''t need much skill to take a beautyfull shot.<br/>It''s all about the beauty you''re shooting. That puts alot of great macro/sport/portrete etc. photos in shade. Colors are always in leading role. Like in here, great colors.<br/>Black against yellowish/orange. Not too much. Wonderfull</td>', 'If there wasn''t for blown out sky I''d vote oure 10. The problem with landscapephotography is that you don''t need much skill to take a beautyfull shot.It''s all about the beauty you''re shooting. That puts alot of great macro/sport/portrete etc. photos in shade. Colors are always in leading role. Like in here, great colors.Black against yellowish/orange. Not too much. Wonderfull', '2005-10-24 19:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808294, 246125, 40371, '<td valign="top">Magnificent color!</td>', 'Magnificent color!', '2005-10-24 19:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
