(1808572, 245771, 44575, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the composition and the B&amp;W treatment.  However, it is a bit blurry (either out of focus, or there is a bit of motion blur on the man w/ the book), and the flash or overhead light in the upper pane is distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the composition and the B&W treatment.  However, it is a bit blurry (either out of focus, or there is a bit of motion blur on the man w/ the book), and the flash or overhead light in the upper pane is distracting.', '2005-10-24 21:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
