(1808588, 246135, 40868, '<td valign="top">Great reflection, but the entire piece is so busy it took me a few moments to realize what I was looking at.</td>', 'Great reflection, but the entire piece is so busy it took me a few moments to realize what I was looking at.', '2005-10-24 21:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808590, 245500, 40868, '<td valign="top">What is it?</td>', 'What is it?', '2005-10-24 21:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808598, 244085, 44575, '<td valign="top">Theres quite a few things that detract from this, IMO.  The venetian blinds and the reflected coffee cup (?) in the lower left. for starters.  The double pane of the glass makes your image quite a bit muddled.  It looks like you were trying to capture sunset, which is a great idea, but I think you missed the good light by a minute or so (the sun is mostly behind the trees now).</td>', 'Theres quite a few things that detract from this, IMO.  The venetian blinds and the reflected coffee cup (?) in the lower left. for starters.  The double pane of the glass makes your image quite a bit muddled.  It looks like you were trying to capture sunset, which is a great idea, but I think you missed the good light by a minute or so (the sun is mostly behind the trees now).', '2005-10-24 21:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808613, 244025, 44575, '<td valign="top">I looks like a reflection, but I can''t tell for sure because the image is so fuzzy -- either out of focus or distorted by the reflecting surface.  I can''t tell if its the latter, because you''ve cropped so tightly.  I''d like to see what the surface is in shots like this.</td>', 'I looks like a reflection, but I can''t tell for sure because the image is so fuzzy -- either out of focus or distorted by the reflecting surface.  I can''t tell if its the latter, because you''ve cropped so tightly.  I''d like to see what the surface is in shots like this.', '2005-10-24 21:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808617, 246306, 44575, '<td valign="top">The fact that you felt the need for such a long descriptive title should be a clue that you didn''t get the composition quite right.  The Apple speaker isn''t that attractive -- particularly the rusty(?) screw -- and has enough detail to distract from the rest of the photo.   The reflection isn''t that compelling, since any detail of the artwork is lost in the distortion and the colors are not that striking.</td>', 'The fact that you felt the need for such a long descriptive title should be a clue that you didn''t get the composition quite right.  The Apple speaker isn''t that attractive -- particularly the rusty(?) screw -- and has enough detail to distract from the rest of the photo.   The reflection isn''t that compelling, since any detail of the artwork is lost in the distortion and the colors are not that striking.', '2005-10-24 21:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808756, 245916, 44575, '<td valign="top">Ok, its water and its reflecting, but its muddy water, and its reflecting a parking lot.  I just don''t get what you are trying to do with this one.</td>', 'Ok, its water and its reflecting, but its muddy water, and its reflecting a parking lot.  I just don''t get what you are trying to do with this one.', '2005-10-24 22:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808770, 245915, 44575, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t do much for me.  The  reflection and background are of a nondescript room.  The only person in the shot is reading a book.  The whole image is static.   I don''t even get the impression that the guy is listening to music.   The reflected image is a bit cluttered.  Maybe having the guy dancing to music would have added a dynamic element that would have tied into the iPod subject better.</td>', 'This doesn''t do much for me.  The  reflection and background are of a nondescript room.  The only person in the shot is reading a book.  The whole image is static.   I don''t even get the impression that the guy is listening to music.   The reflected image is a bit cluttered.  Maybe having the guy dancing to music would have added a dynamic element that would have tied into the iPod subject better.', '2005-10-24 22:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808783, 246171, 44575, '<td valign="top">The reflection doesn''t really add much if anything to this picture, IMO.  The expression on the bride and groom''s faces could say quite a bit -- are they tired, uncertain about the future, or just drunk (bachelor/bachelorette party, perhaps)?  A bit more emotion could really make this shot.   The choice of background is unfortunate -- the wood paneling makes this looks too much like a snapshot.</td>', 'The reflection doesn''t really add much if anything to this picture, IMO.  The expression on the bride and groom''s faces could say quite a bit -- are they tired, uncertain about the future, or just drunk (bachelor/bachelorette party, perhaps)?  A bit more emotion could really make this shot.   The choice of background is unfortunate -- the wood paneling makes this looks too much like a snapshot.', '2005-10-24 22:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808791, 244766, 44575, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at here.  The glare of the sky really overpowers the entire shot.  A little less exposure might have retained more details of the building across the way and the sky (seems to be some nice cloud trails in there somewhere).  The digital time and date in the lower left corner really detracts from the submitted photo.</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at here.  The glare of the sky really overpowers the entire shot.  A little less exposure might have retained more details of the building across the way and the sky (seems to be some nice cloud trails in there somewhere).  The digital time and date in the lower left corner really detracts from the submitted photo.', '2005-10-24 22:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808799, 245051, 44575, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the composition in this one.  The bridge is nice, but the traffic detracts from the shot and the bridge isn''t well placed to higlight it.   A more dramatic shot lined along the bridge a bit more would be better.   The image behind the glass adds nothing to the shot -- I didn''t know it was a store until I read the title.</td>', 'I don''t really like the composition in this one.  The bridge is nice, but the traffic detracts from the shot and the bridge isn''t well placed to higlight it.   A more dramatic shot lined along the bridge a bit more would be better.   The image behind the glass adds nothing to the shot -- I didn''t know it was a store until I read the title.', '2005-10-24 22:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808801, 245145, 44575, '<td valign="top">The composition is a classic one -- wine glasses and candles are a surefire romantic shot.   The focus seems a bit soft across the entire picture.   The colors a bit dark and muddy and the image has quite a bit of noise in it.</td>', 'The composition is a classic one -- wine glasses and candles are a surefire romantic shot.   The focus seems a bit soft across the entire picture.   The colors a bit dark and muddy and the image has quite a bit of noise in it.', '2005-10-24 22:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808806, 244044, 44575, '<td valign="top">An interesting perspective, but the subject is somewhat unappealing.  I like the contrast between white and dark spaces, but the reflection doesn''t really add much to the picture.    Might have been a stronger shot with a vertical, rather than horizontal orientation.</td>', 'An interesting perspective, but the subject is somewhat unappealing.  I like the contrast between white and dark spaces, but the reflection doesn''t really add much to the picture.    Might have been a stronger shot with a vertical, rather than horizontal orientation.', '2005-10-24 22:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808807, 245738, 44575, '<td valign="top">Cute puppy, but doesn''t really meet the challenge.</td>', 'Cute puppy, but doesn''t really meet the challenge.', '2005-10-24 22:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808809, 244605, 44575, '<td valign="top">A very cute shot, but the reflections don''t really add to the picture.  In fact, they look like something you would try to avoid in any situation, other than this challenge.</td>', 'A very cute shot, but the reflections don''t really add to the picture.  In fact, they look like something you would try to avoid in any situation, other than this challenge.', '2005-10-24 22:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808813, 245954, 44575, '<td valign="top">Nothing in this photo really draws me in.  Yes, there''s a reflection, but its just of the building across the way.  The people in the street don''t really make an impact.  More interesting would be to reflect a woman looking in and thus appearing to mirror the mannekin, or a shot of people walking away, adding a sense of isolation.</td>', 'Nothing in this photo really draws me in.  Yes, there''s a reflection, but its just of the building across the way.  The people in the street don''t really make an impact.  More interesting would be to reflect a woman looking in and thus appearing to mirror the mannekin, or a shot of people walking away, adding a sense of isolation.', '2005-10-24 22:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808820, 245863, 44575, '<td valign="top">The reflection doesn''t really add anything to the photo.  The background doesn''t really show off the Playstation.   The lighting is too muted -- none of the controls on the face really stand out.</td>', 'The reflection doesn''t really add anything to the photo.  The background doesn''t really show off the Playstation.   The lighting is too muted -- none of the controls on the face really stand out.', '2005-10-24 22:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808827, 245948, 44575, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really do anything for me.  I wouldn''t have known it was a guitar w/o the title.   The reflected image doesn''t really scream "Rock and Roll"  to me.   It would have been better either with the guitar flipped over so we can see the strings or at least with less of a crop to see what the reflecting surface is.   I''d also dress the model up to look more like a rockstar or musician.</td>', 'Doesn''t really do anything for me.  I wouldn''t have known it was a guitar w/o the title.   The reflected image doesn''t really scream "Rock and Roll"  to me.   It would have been better either with the guitar flipped over so we can see the strings or at least with less of a crop to see what the reflecting surface is.   I''d also dress the model up to look more like a rockstar or musician.', '2005-10-24 22:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808835, 244892, 44575, '<td valign="top">Kinda pushes the defintion of reflection.  Beyond that the composition isn''t that interesting.  The lighting looks like a simple flash -- it needs more drama.  The textured ceiling acts as a distraction, as well.</td>', 'Kinda pushes the defintion of reflection.  Beyond that the composition isn''t that interesting.  The lighting looks like a simple flash -- it needs more drama.  The textured ceiling acts as a distraction, as well.', '2005-10-24 22:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808839, 245209, 44575, '<td valign="top">Argh.  Why such a small photo?  I can barely see what''s going on!  The trees are somewhat dark -- your losing the beauty to the shadows.  The meeting room is unattractive and dark as well.</td>', 'Argh.  Why such a small photo?  I can barely see what''s going on!  The trees are somewhat dark -- your losing the beauty to the shadows.  The meeting room is unattractive and dark as well.', '2005-10-24 22:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
