(1809225, 244155, 45927, '<td valign="top">Creative. :) I really like the black and white approach- adds a sense of drama. Love the reflecting sheet music, so subtle, and yet so striking... Nice. :)</td>', 'Creative. :) I really like the black and white approach- adds a sense of drama. Love the reflecting sheet music, so subtle, and yet so striking... Nice. :)', '2005-10-25 01:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
