(1809421, 244521, 39349, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Maybe too hot for some but I like it! 10</td>', 'Very cool. Maybe too hot for some but I like it! 10', '2005-10-25 02:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809426, 245500, 45566, '<td valign="top">looks like a test render for some 3d modeller.  Not sure why, but I really like this.</td>', 'looks like a test render for some 3d modeller.  Not sure why, but I really like this.', '2005-10-25 02:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809427, 244057, 45566, '<td valign="top">fantastic, i love the way that you not only get reflection, but the distortion as well</td>', 'fantastic, i love the way that you not only get reflection, but the distortion as well', '2005-10-25 02:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809430, 244963, 39349, '<td valign="top">This is totally awesome! This has to be in the top 10 if not 3. I give you my highest for a beautifully done capture that if flawless, 10!</td>', 'This is totally awesome! This has to be in the top 10 if not 3. I give you my highest for a beautifully done capture that if flawless, 10!', '2005-10-25 02:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809431, 244676, 45566, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but might it have looked a little more impressive if you''d polished up the 50p a bit?</td>', 'Nice concept, but might it have looked a little more impressive if you''d polished up the 50p a bit?', '2005-10-25 02:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809432, 245251, 45927, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. I also like the perspective shown in the photo, more interesting, and makes the reflection more at an angle, making it more interesting- to me anyway. Nice job. :)</td>', 'Love the colors. I also like the perspective shown in the photo, more interesting, and makes the reflection more at an angle, making it more interesting- to me anyway. Nice job. :)', '2005-10-25 02:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809435, 244041, 45566, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, I''m just a little distracted by whatever that is in the bottom left.  I''d like to have seen it cropped a bit higher.  (But hey, I''m a noob, and my composition sucks)</td>', 'I like the shot, I''m just a little distracted by whatever that is in the bottom left.  I''d like to have seen it cropped a bit higher.  (But hey, I''m a noob, and my composition sucks)', '2005-10-25 02:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809437, 244959, 45566, '<td valign="top">lovely haunting shot</td>', 'lovely haunting shot', '2005-10-25 02:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809440, 244243, 45566, '<td valign="top">I really like that the reflection is almost incidental to the picture, not the main focus of it.</td>', 'I really like that the reflection is almost incidental to the picture, not the main focus of it.', '2005-10-25 02:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809441, 246214, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great job...once again! I think there''s this one place called Moab, you should try and shoot some pictures there, I hear it''s beautiful! Only thing I see hurting this shot is that it''s blown out on the top right hand side, I think this limits one from seeing that the reflection keeps going through the shot. I''m wondering if people think that the mountains reflected in the pool are actually rock?<br/> <br/>Still a sweet shot with great detail in the prints left behind by man''s best friend.<br/> <br/>Good luck!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-30 15:09:41.</i></td>', 'Great job...once again! I think there''s this one place called Moab, you should try and shoot some pictures there, I hear it''s beautiful! Only thing I see hurting this shot is that it''s blown out on the top right hand side, I think this limits one from seeing that the reflection keeps going through the shot. I''m wondering if people think that the mountains reflected in the pool are actually rock? Still a sweet shot with great detail in the prints left behind by man''s best friend. Good luck!', '2005-10-25 02:34:07.000000', '2005-10-30 15:09:41.000000', 1),
(1809445, 245455, 45927, '<td valign="top">Maybe could''ve gotten a better shot of the reflection of the sky, and less ground. And maybe change the lighting, kind of drastic, and not flattering.</td>', 'Maybe could''ve gotten a better shot of the reflection of the sky, and less ground. And maybe change the lighting, kind of drastic, and not flattering.', '2005-10-25 02:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809454, 246452, 45927, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but actual shot is kind of boring. Maybe a different perspective shot of the dominos stacked upright one after the other.</td>', 'Cool idea, but actual shot is kind of boring. Maybe a different perspective shot of the dominos stacked upright one after the other.', '2005-10-25 02:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809460, 245497, 45927, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. :) I like the overall feeling it gives me- very tranquil, as well as how the picture was presented (layout of objects) and the subtle perspective, nice touch. It''s like the boat''s just asking to be taken out for a ride. Cool. :)</td>', 'Nice and simple. :) I like the overall feeling it gives me- very tranquil, as well as how the picture was presented (layout of objects) and the subtle perspective, nice touch. It''s like the boat''s just asking to be taken out for a ride. Cool. :)', '2005-10-25 02:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809468, 244631, 45927, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection in the sun glasses, and the colors. :) Awesomeness. Also love the lighting around the edges- makes the glasses and the reflection seem so bright and crisp. Nice. :)</td>', 'Love the reflection in the sun glasses, and the colors. :) Awesomeness. Also love the lighting around the edges- makes the glasses and the reflection seem so bright and crisp. Nice. :)', '2005-10-25 02:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809476, 244782, 45927, '<td valign="top">I really love the colors. ^^ It''s such an interesting picture, with an equally awesome reflection. The angle of the shot really adds to it also. Nice. :)</td>', 'I really love the colors. ^^ It''s such an interesting picture, with an equally awesome reflection. The angle of the shot really adds to it also. Nice. :)', '2005-10-25 03:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809480, 246303, 45927, '<td valign="top">Really like the perspective and angles of this picture. There are so many lines that lead me somewhere. I feel so drawn into it... O.O Love it. ^^</td>', 'Really like the perspective and angles of this picture. There are so many lines that lead me somewhere. I feel so drawn into it... O.O Love it. ^^', '2005-10-25 03:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809500, 244895, 45927, '<td valign="top">Can''t really see what you were trying to reflect... I do like the ripples though. Mabye try and find something with more color to reflect in water.</td>', 'Can''t really see what you were trying to reflect... I do like the ripples though. Mabye try and find something with more color to reflect in water.', '2005-10-25 03:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809509, 245662, 45927, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the continuous reflection in the windows, but maybe some color would make it more interesting. (?)</td>', 'I like the perspective and the continuous reflection in the windows, but maybe some color would make it more interesting. (?)', '2005-10-25 03:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809515, 245937, 45927, '<td valign="top">Really love the reflection in this picture- it like blends into it''s background the sky. Awesome. The perspective is a nice touch also. :)</td>', 'Really love the reflection in this picture- it like blends into it''s background the sky. Awesome. The perspective is a nice touch also. :)', '2005-10-25 03:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809516, 245978, 46056, '<td valign="top">I love it!  My husband always teases me that I have hundreds of photos of seagulls - but they look so good!  Great shot - simple yet so unusual =;-)</td>', 'I love it!  My husband always teases me that I have hundreds of photos of seagulls - but they look so good!  Great shot - simple yet so unusual =;-)', '2005-10-25 03:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809517, 245500, 46056, '<td valign="top">The more I look at it, the more I see =;-)</td>', 'The more I look at it, the more I see =;-)', '2005-10-25 03:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809518, 244175, 46056, '<td valign="top">The background is a little distracting.  The idea of the reflection in the glasses is good, though.</td>', 'The background is a little distracting.  The idea of the reflection in the glasses is good, though.', '2005-10-25 03:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809519, 244962, 46056, '<td valign="top">The ''wibbly-wobbly'' building is really great.  Shame about the white bars down the picture, they do distract from the effect.</td>', 'The ''wibbly-wobbly'' building is really great.  Shame about the white bars down the picture, they do distract from the effect.', '2005-10-25 03:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809521, 244954, 46056, '<td valign="top">How long did you have to sit to catch the sunlight on the house just right?  Lovely.</td>', 'How long did you have to sit to catch the sunlight on the house just right?  Lovely.', '2005-10-25 03:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809523, 244226, 46056, '<td valign="top">There is something very appropriate about the way you have taken this shot.  It is almost clinical.  It appeals to me - simplicity can be striking.  Good job!</td>', 'There is something very appropriate about the way you have taken this shot.  It is almost clinical.  It appeals to me - simplicity can be striking.  Good job!', '2005-10-25 03:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809525, 243839, 46056, '<td valign="top">I like the honesty in this shot - graffiti, crane and all.  A different take from many of the picturesque harbour shots featured in this challenge.  A brave choice.</td>', 'I like the honesty in this shot - graffiti, crane and all.  A different take from many of the picturesque harbour shots featured in this challenge.  A brave choice.', '2005-10-25 03:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809530, 244881, 46056, '<td valign="top">This bridge is not the most architecturally interesting, but the colour in the water really sells this picture.</td>', 'This bridge is not the most architecturally interesting, but the colour in the water really sells this picture.', '2005-10-25 04:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809531, 244882, 45927, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and reflections, but I don''t really like the color of the glass... It looks dirty, which annoys me. Maybe using clearer glasses, and better lighting would help. Just a thought though.</td>', 'Cool idea and reflections, but I don''t really like the color of the glass... It looks dirty, which annoys me. Maybe using clearer glasses, and better lighting would help. Just a thought though.', '2005-10-25 04:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809532, 245152, 46056, '<td valign="top">Subtle - very nice.</td>', 'Subtle - very nice.', '2005-10-25 04:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809536, 245521, 46056, '<td valign="top">The light falls on the central birds face just right here.  I stared at this photo for quite a while - very restful.</td>', 'The light falls on the central birds face just right here.  I stared at this photo for quite a while - very restful.', '2005-10-25 04:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809538, 245162, 46056, '<td valign="top">These colours are warm and fabulous.  A gorgeous photograph.</td>', 'These colours are warm and fabulous.  A gorgeous photograph.', '2005-10-25 04:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809539, 246235, 46056, '<td valign="top">The rustic finish to the window perfectly compliments the reflection subject.  Has the green been brightened - is it perhaps a shade too bright?  Maybe not.  Great chalky quality, though.  I like it.</td>', 'The rustic finish to the window perfectly compliments the reflection subject.  Has the green been brightened - is it perhaps a shade too bright?  Maybe not.  Great chalky quality, though.  I like it.', '2005-10-25 04:10:37.000000', NULL, 1);
