(1809674, 244154, 27133, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  The story portrayed within and the emotion within the man on the right.  Outstanding work.  This photo really touched me. 10 and a favourite.</td>', 'I love this photo.  The story portrayed within and the emotion within the man on the right.  Outstanding work.  This photo really touched me. 10 and a favourite.', '2005-10-25 07:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
