(1809704, 244657, 42514, '<td valign="top">The idea is excellent, I must say. Should it have been me behind the camera I would have positioned the model differently though... Say slightly more to the left and maybe looking upwards reflecting a tall building in the city or  some bird, tree of flower with a contrasting colour to the eyes if taken in the countryside because one cannot really admire the colour of her eyes. But anyways that''s me... Good job ;-)</td>', 'The idea is excellent, I must say. Should it have been me behind the camera I would have positioned the model differently though... Say slightly more to the left and maybe looking upwards reflecting a tall building in the city or  some bird, tree of flower with a contrasting colour to the eyes if taken in the countryside because one cannot really admire the colour of her eyes. But anyways that''s me... Good job ;-)', '2005-10-25 08:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809707, 245845, 42514, '<td valign="top">Beautiful I must say... Malteser</td>', 'Beautiful I must say... Malteser', '2005-10-25 08:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
