(1810549, 245598, 27482, '<td valign="top">Clever use of what I assume is a polarizer but other than that, it´s not really impressing me, I am not at all fond of the black material you used for a backround, the dust spots are a bit distracting.  Anyhow, very creative and fitting for the challengeso I still gave this a 7</td>', 'Clever use of what I assume is a polarizer but other than that, it´s not really impressing me, I am not at all fond of the black material you used for a backround, the dust spots are a bit distracting.  Anyhow, very creative and fitting for the challengeso I still gave this a 7', '2005-10-25 14:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1810550, 245577, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, I bet some people don´t think it fit´s the challenge but I am not one of them and I really like this shot, it just works for me and I gave it a 9.  Especially like the DOF and colours.</td>', 'Nice, I bet some people don´t think it fit´s the challenge but I am not one of them and I really like this shot, it just works for me and I gave it a 9.  Especially like the DOF and colours.', '2005-10-25 14:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1810554, 246022, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, one of the best "autumn colours reflected in water" shots in the challenge, the wood sticking up out of the lake makes it stand out.  7 from me.</td>', 'Nice, one of the best "autumn colours reflected in water" shots in the challenge, the wood sticking up out of the lake makes it stand out.  7 from me.', '2005-10-25 14:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1810568, 245453, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, but nothing I haven´t seen before.  I think I would have liked this more if the water had been more still and the reflection clearer but still technically speaking pretty nice so I think it´s above average in the challenge, gave this a 6.</td>', 'Nice, but nothing I haven´t seen before.  I think I would have liked this more if the water had been more still and the reflection clearer but still technically speaking pretty nice so I think it´s above average in the challenge, gave this a 6.', '2005-10-25 14:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1810572, 243993, 44860, '<td valign="top">Nice. Learn to submit it bigger.</td>', 'Nice. Learn to submit it bigger.', '2005-10-25 14:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1810574, 243745, 27482, '<td valign="top">You silly person, why take a photo of that tool when you have a babe in a bikini behind you, I would have given her a 10 automatically :P</td>', 'You silly person, why take a photo of that tool when you have a babe in a bikini behind you, I would have given her a 10 automatically :P', '2005-10-25 14:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
