(1811968, 246214, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I do like this, and/but(?) the title carries a certain amount of ''weight'' here in my opinion, primarily in regard to the fact I may not have picked up on the ''paw prints'' without your title, but I do like the title and am not implying you are ''forcing it''.  Criticism; I would like to see more ''context'', it is difficult in my opinion to discern the ''top'' and ''right'' part of this shot, ie: ''real'' or ''reflection'', which I would like to have ''realized''.  The shot is kind of ''abstract'' though in an unusual (and good) way.  Colors are nice.</td>', '7 - I do like this, and/but(?) the title carries a certain amount of ''weight'' here in my opinion, primarily in regard to the fact I may not have picked up on the ''paw prints'' without your title, but I do like the title and am not implying you are ''forcing it''.  Criticism; I would like to see more ''context'', it is difficult in my opinion to discern the ''top'' and ''right'' part of this shot, ie: ''real'' or ''reflection'', which I would like to have ''realized''.  The shot is kind of ''abstract'' though in an unusual (and good) way.  Colors are nice.', '2005-10-25 20:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1812016, 246189, 35804, '<td valign="top">I just really like this...I''ve been back to look at it quite a few times because I find it somewhat "refreshing"...It thinks it''s all those fantastic greens, the lighting is super nice too.</td>', 'I just really like this...I''ve been back to look at it quite a few times because I find it somewhat "refreshing"...It thinks it''s all those fantastic greens, the lighting is super nice too.', '2005-10-25 20:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
