(1812070, 244395, 44996, '<td valign="top">hrm... oddly reminicent of a previous winner... <br/> <br/>nice image regaurdless. I like the contrast between the sharp reality and the blurry reflection.</td>', 'hrm... oddly reminicent of a previous winner...  nice image regaurdless. I like the contrast between the sharp reality and the blurry reflection.', '2005-10-25 21:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
