(1812795, 245771, 45566, '<td valign="top">I took 10 or 15 shots on the train that morning, and the reason for the blurriness (yes, it was accidental, not on purpose) was that I had to hand hold the camera, with no flash, on a moving train before 7 in the morning. :)<br/> <br/>As for the light in the top middle, it''s actually a street light outside the train.  I chose to include it to show that it really wasn''t a mirror.  A bad idea I agree.  Thanks for all the comments :)</td>', 'I took 10 or 15 shots on the train that morning, and the reason for the blurriness (yes, it was accidental, not on purpose) was that I had to hand hold the camera, with no flash, on a moving train before 7 in the morning. :) As for the light in the top middle, it''s actually a street light outside the train.  I chose to include it to show that it really wasn''t a mirror.  A bad idea I agree.  Thanks for all the comments :)', '2005-10-26 01:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
