(1812968, 246235, 16780, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments.  The lighter high key color was intentional.  I liked the look.  For the lighthouse, I think it spoke more about its history this way.  Judging from the comments &amp; score spread, many like it &amp; many don''t....just a matter of taste.  As a whole, I photograph to appeal to a select market, so it wont appeal to all.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments.  The lighter high key color was intentional.  I liked the look.  For the lighthouse, I think it spoke more about its history this way.  Judging from the comments & score spread, many like it & many don''t....just a matter of taste.  As a whole, I photograph to appeal to a select market, so it wont appeal to all.', '2005-10-26 01:41:12.000000', NULL, 0),
