(1813526, 246408, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is very sweet. Nice work on the dark tones, not an easy task.</td>', 'This is very sweet. Nice work on the dark tones, not an easy task.', '2005-10-26 04:04:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813528, 243836, 21009, '<td valign="top">First of, thank you for all the comments...<br/> <br/>i kind of figured no one would see where the reflection was...<br/> <br/>it is a picture of a rooftop puddle...the white stuff...thats the floor and then the yellowish stuff is water.  in that puddle, there is a reflection of scaffolding that is directly above it and, for the most part, out of the frame frame. except for that brownish red bar in the top right corner.<br/> <br/>i donno if i could would of figured that out if it was someone elses picture...<br/> <br/>but i kind of wish you guys woulda just taken my word for the reflection being there.<br/> <br/></td>', 'First of, thank you for all the comments... i kind of figured no one would see where the reflection was... it is a picture of a rooftop puddle...the white stuff...thats the floor and then the yellowish stuff is water.  in that puddle, there is a reflection of scaffolding that is directly above it and, for the most part, out of the frame frame. except for that brownish red bar in the top right corner. i donno if i could would of figured that out if it was someone elses picture... but i kind of wish you guys woulda just taken my word for the reflection being there. ', '2005-10-26 04:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813531, 246088, 22781, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, very very beautifull</td>', 'Congratulations, very very beautifull', '2005-10-26 04:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813537, 243894, 41899, '<td valign="top">In response to your request for feedback, I couldn''t really make out what this pink thing was in the reflection.  I kinda thought it looked like some strawberries in melted ice cream.  I like the sharpness of the digital reading compared to the softness of the reflection.  I gave you a 5 for aesthetic value.  Would have scored higher if I could have figured out what it was.</td>', 'In response to your request for feedback, I couldn''t really make out what this pink thing was in the reflection.  I kinda thought it looked like some strawberries in melted ice cream.  I like the sharpness of the digital reading compared to the softness of the reflection.  I gave you a 5 for aesthetic value.  Would have scored higher if I could have figured out what it was.', '2005-10-26 04:19:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813541, 244395, 4517, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. Well done.</td>', 'This is really nice. Well done.', '2005-10-26 04:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813550, 244395, 25708, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary image, congratulations!!For me photography is all about creating a feeling in the soul of the one who''s looking at the picture!This is one of those pictures...<br/>It sais something!<br/>Congratulations!</td>', 'Extraordinary image, congratulations!!For me photography is all about creating a feeling in the soul of the one who''s looking at the picture!This is one of those pictures...It sais something!Congratulations!', '2005-10-26 04:29:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813565, 245250, 35322, '<td valign="top">If you look carefuly at the picture (right down corner) you can see that this isn''t an arch that you can see through, but it''s an arch-shaped window and all you see inside it''s the reflexion of what was going on behind me. <br/> <br/>Thanks to those who saw the reflexion in my picture and gaved constructive comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-26 05:39:29.</i></td>', 'If you look carefuly at the picture (right down corner) you can see that this isn''t an arch that you can see through, but it''s an arch-shaped window and all you see inside it''s the reflexion of what was going on behind me.  Thanks to those who saw the reflexion in my picture and gaved constructive comments.', '2005-10-26 04:43:49.000000', '2005-10-26 06:39:29.000000', 0),
(1813570, 244353, 12089, '<td valign="top">a fantastic shot congrats !!! i loved it !!!!!!!!!:D</td>', 'a fantastic shot congrats !!! i loved it !!!!!!!!!:D', '2005-10-26 04:45:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813575, 244395, 6912, '<td valign="top">A real beauty!!!! Congratulations, mate!</td>', 'A real beauty!!!! Congratulations, mate!', '2005-10-26 04:49:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813632, 245946, 42666, '<td valign="top">well this was a dissapointment<br/>i dont diserve the one''s thats for shure</td>', 'well this was a dissapointmenti dont diserve the one''s thats for shure', '2005-10-26 05:30:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813636, 246088, 42171, '<td valign="top">Well done! I knew this one would do well (I gave you a 9!)</td>', 'Well done! I knew this one would do well (I gave you a 9!)', '2005-10-26 05:33:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813662, 244353, 18450, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!! Congrats on your well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Fantastic shot!! Congrats on your well deserved ribbon!', '2005-10-26 06:13:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813673, 246124, 32848, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments.  The picture was taken deliberately at dusk as lighting here is a real pain.  The cottages are in the shadow of a large mill just to the right of this image most of the day spoiling the picture, earlier in the day the light is behind them so I had little option if a ''shadowless'' picture was to be taken.  The item to the left is a narrowboat which is not very clear.  The sky was also clear so no interest there...<br/> <br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks for your comments.  The picture was taken deliberately at dusk as lighting here is a real pain.  The cottages are in the shadow of a large mill just to the right of this image most of the day spoiling the picture, earlier in the day the light is behind them so I had little option if a ''shadowless'' picture was to be taken.  The item to the left is a narrowboat which is not very clear.  The sky was also clear so no interest there... Thanks again.', '2005-10-26 06:19:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813675, 246088, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  Been a while since an Icelander got a ribbon and I am very glad it was two new ones.  Many more to come, I am sure.<br/> <br/>(Edit: Fixed a typo)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-26 05:37:29.</i></td>', 'Congrats!  Been a while since an Icelander got a ribbon and I am very glad it was two new ones.  Many more to come, I am sure. (Edit: Fixed a typo)', '2005-10-26 06:20:48.000000', '2005-10-26 06:37:29.000000', 0),
(1813677, 244353, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  Been a while since an Icelander got a ribbon and I am very glad it was two new ones.  Many more to come, I am sure.<br/> <br/>(Edit: Fixed a typo)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-26 05:39:29.</i></td>', 'Congrats!  Been a while since an Icelander got a ribbon and I am very glad it was two new ones.  Many more to come, I am sure. (Edit: Fixed a typo)', '2005-10-26 06:21:15.000000', '2005-10-26 06:39:29.000000', 0),
(1813682, 245414, 45559, '<td valign="top">I would like to know what''s wrong with the photo?!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-26 08:11:33.</i></td>', 'I would like to know what''s wrong with the photo?!', '2005-10-26 06:25:12.000000', '2005-10-26 09:11:33.000000', 0),
(1813684, 244353, 45965, '<td valign="top">One of those pictures that make you go "well why didn''t I think of that...". :-)<br/> <br/>Excellent idea and execution, well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'One of those pictures that make you go "well why didn''t I think of that...". :-) Excellent idea and execution, well deserved ribbon!', '2005-10-26 06:26:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813692, 244676, 44486, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and suggestions everyone, much appriciated, ill keep them in mind next time.<br/> <br/>For those who say they can''t see the reflection then i''d like to add that you therefore can''t see. Every object has a reflection, liht is reflecting off of everyrthing and then into our eyes. Its the only way we can see. So thewrefore this is the way i choose to interpret it, in theory i could of taken a picture of anythin because its still a reflection as it is reflecting light.<br/> <br/>But thanks aain for voting and for everyones constructive comments (and on second thoughts i agree, its a bit too briht)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments and suggestions everyone, much appriciated, ill keep them in mind next time. For those who say they can''t see the reflection then i''d like to add that you therefore can''t see. Every object has a reflection, liht is reflecting off of everyrthing and then into our eyes. Its the only way we can see. So thewrefore this is the way i choose to interpret it, in theory i could of taken a picture of anythin because its still a reflection as it is reflecting light. But thanks aain for voting and for everyones constructive comments (and on second thoughts i agree, its a bit too briht)', '2005-10-26 06:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813694, 246219, 7810, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top ten for this lovely shot, well done!</td>', 'Congrats on the top ten for this lovely shot, well done!', '2005-10-26 06:33:17.000000', NULL, 0),
