(1813811, 244226, 10413, '<td valign="top">I expected this to do better than it did. Religious subject photos don''t seem to get the recognition they should.</td>', 'I expected this to do better than it did. Religious subject photos don''t seem to get the recognition they should.', '2005-10-26 08:07:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1813822, 244975, 10413, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe how many low scores this got.  It is such a creative shot. I am one who hates any kind of scary movies, violence, etc. but thought this was great for this time of year. (at least where they celebrate halloween)</td>', 'I can''t believe how many low scores this got.  It is such a creative shot. I am one who hates any kind of scary movies, violence, etc. but thought this was great for this time of year. (at least where they celebrate halloween)', '2005-10-26 08:19:05.000000', NULL, 0);
