(1815458, 246304, 14614, '<td valign="top">The subject isn''t as compelling to me as some of your other "man made" ones.  I''m tending to focus on the technical aspect here and I get caught up in the not-quite-parallel background, the odd crop on the right and the dark base.  Didn''t vote but I would have scored this about average.</td>', 'The subject isn''t as compelling to me as some of your other "man made" ones.  I''m tending to focus on the technical aspect here and I get caught up in the not-quite-parallel background, the odd crop on the right and the dark base.  Didn''t vote but I would have scored this about average.', '2005-10-26 16:54:14.000000', NULL, 0),
