(1815962, 245954, 30817, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by leaf:</b></div><hr/><i> well thanks for the comments.  I agree a woman looking in could be intersting, but i liked how the copule was walking at a distance.. it gives the maneqin a wishful look... a look wanting to be one of ''them''. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>A subtlety like that will be noticed four times out of 300 votes here, though it could be studied in a gallery.  My point .... don''t let anything that does or does not happen for you on this or any other site, change your perspective.  You can say, "It won''t." but if you become obsessed to get ribbons here, you will find your stylizations evolving to somewhere they didn''t start out going.  Your heart is your only teacher.  You know how to take pictures.</td>', 'Originally posted by leaf: well thanks for the comments.  I agree a woman looking in could be intersting, but i liked how the copule was walking at a distance.. it gives the maneqin a wishful look... a look wanting to be one of ''them''.   A subtlety like that will be noticed four times out of 300 votes here, though it could be studied in a gallery.  My point .... don''t let anything that does or does not happen for you on this or any other site, change your perspective.  You can say, "It won''t." but if you become obsessed to get ribbons here, you will find your stylizations evolving to somewhere they didn''t start out going.  Your heart is your only teacher.  You know how to take pictures.', '2005-10-26 19:42:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1815963, 244395, 38234, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your FIRST PLACE win!!</td>', 'Congratulations on your FIRST PLACE win!!', '2005-10-26 19:42:18.000000', NULL, 0),
