(1821822, 243894, 45857, '<td valign="top">I was one of 65 5''s you recieved. Due to the staggering partication in this challenge, I didn''t have time to get back to my 5''s, I start from the ends and rejudge toward the middle. Your concept was near brillant and well done. I think the fact that you skewed the scale reading to focus on that segment of the population which tends toward dysmorphic body concepts makes it more effective. The little touches do help. I wish I had scored it better now. Highlighting the scale face would have meant dis-assembly and installing lights under the scale frame.</td>', 'I was one of 65 5''s you recieved. Due to the staggering partication in this challenge, I didn''t have time to get back to my 5''s, I start from the ends and rejudge toward the middle. Your concept was near brillant and well done. I think the fact that you skewed the scale reading to focus on that segment of the population which tends toward dysmorphic body concepts makes it more effective. The little touches do help. I wish I had scored it better now. Highlighting the scale face would have meant dis-assembly and installing lights under the scale frame.', '2005-10-28 19:49:03.000000', NULL, 0),
