(1856459, 244291, 40718, '<td valign="top">geez, skate4aganja wasn''t a fan, was he?  You could have gone two ways with this pic.  1) crop tigher to leave just 3 or 4 slats above and below the picture.  2) accentuate the imbalance by shifting the windows even lower.  That might have also removed some of the lower portion which isn''t quite as pretty as the upper slats.  The reflection portion is cool and I like the repeated quality of it.</td>', 'geez, skate4aganja wasn''t a fan, was he?  You could have gone two ways with this pic.  1) crop tigher to leave just 3 or 4 slats above and below the picture.  2) accentuate the imbalance by shifting the windows even lower.  That might have also removed some of the lower portion which isn''t quite as pretty as the upper slats.  The reflection portion is cool and I like the repeated quality of it.', '2005-11-10 19:58:06.000000', NULL, 0),
