(1863380, 246219, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a magical quality to it.  Love the gray blue night sky colors.  The reflection of the moon along with the silhouette on the dock - it looks like a book jacket!!</td>', 'This has a magical quality to it.  Love the gray blue night sky colors.  The reflection of the moon along with the silhouette on the dock - it looks like a book jacket!!', '2005-11-13 23:31:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1866183, 245251, 24940, '<td valign="top">Hello Abhishek,<br/> <br/>This is a very nice image.  I really like the colors and the way you have captured the grandiosity of this structure.  I, too, would like to have seen more of the reflection - maybe by having moved a bit left and closer to the water to minimize the edge of the pool.  Doing so would have given the picture more up/down symmetry, adding interest and impact.  Great photograph, in its own right, though.  Keep up the good work!  :)</td>', 'Hello Abhishek, This is a very nice image.  I really like the colors and the way you have captured the grandiosity of this structure.  I, too, would like to have seen more of the reflection - maybe by having moved a bit left and closer to the water to minimize the edge of the pool.  Doing so would have given the picture more up/down symmetry, adding interest and impact.  Great photograph, in its own right, though.  Keep up the good work!  :)', '2005-11-14 18:56:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1866984, 246411, 40718, '<td valign="top">I gave your pic a 5 when voting this challenge.  I didn''t look at other comments before leaving this one.  The first thing that grabs me is that the horizon appears off level.  This may not, in reality, be true, but then either the left or the right of the camera is further from your lens giving it the impression it is crooked.<br/> <br/>Your lighting is quite good.  The contrasts do well too.  I think you got hit with low votes because your reflection is not really the emphasis of the picture.  It feels more like the reflection is an afterthought.  Perhaps a more clearly reflective surface (plate of glass?) could have added to the reflection.</td>', 'I gave your pic a 5 when voting this challenge.  I didn''t look at other comments before leaving this one.  The first thing that grabs me is that the horizon appears off level.  This may not, in reality, be true, but then either the left or the right of the camera is further from your lens giving it the impression it is crooked. Your lighting is quite good.  The contrasts do well too.  I think you got hit with low votes because your reflection is not really the emphasis of the picture.  It feels more like the reflection is an afterthought.  Perhaps a more clearly reflective surface (plate of glass?) could have added to the reflection.', '2005-11-14 23:04:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1871576, 244155, 31889, '<td valign="top">Excellent first submission.<br/> <br/>Well done.<br/> <br/>bazz.</td>', 'Excellent first submission. Well done. bazz.', '2005-11-16 02:35:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1876090, 245508, 41799, '<td valign="top">6 second handheld makes this amazing, even without considering anything else. If I saw a print of it, I might be a bit troubled by the shake on the trees but at this size it not only doesn''t bother me but actually adds something to the photo. Almost an unnatural DOF, gives that first glance a pleasant kick.<br/> <br/>It''s a beautiful photo. The reflection is not the classic type (if there is such a thing) and I really think that adds to this photo.</td>', '6 second handheld makes this amazing, even without considering anything else. If I saw a print of it, I might be a bit troubled by the shake on the trees but at this size it not only doesn''t bother me but actually adds something to the photo. Almost an unnatural DOF, gives that first glance a pleasant kick. It''s a beautiful photo. The reflection is not the classic type (if there is such a thing) and I really think that adds to this photo.', '2005-11-17 03:21:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1886466, 246188, 30861, '<td valign="top">Having looked at the original, I can see room for an extra small amount at the top that would still leave the development unseen. This would include a portion of trees on the right, and I think it would make all the difference.</td>', 'Having looked at the original, I can see room for an extra small amount at the top that would still leave the development unseen. This would include a portion of trees on the right, and I think it would make all the difference.', '2005-11-21 02:25:34.000000', NULL, 0),
