(2361013, 246219, 30861, '<td valign="top">I just stumbled on this, which somehow I missed before. It''s very beautiful. The tonalities you have generated here, the purity of the steely blue, are very evocative. I''d wish the sun reflection weren''t touching the bottom of the frame, and I might try to mute the slightly more greenish cast in the glare upper right, but that''s about it. First-rate shot, and belated congrats from me to you!</td>', 'I just stumbled on this, which somehow I missed before. It''s very beautiful. The tonalities you have generated here, the purity of the steely blue, are very evocative. I''d wish the sun reflection weren''t touching the bottom of the frame, and I might try to mute the slightly more greenish cast in the glare upper right, but that''s about it. First-rate shot, and belated congrats from me to you!', '2006-04-30 04:30:31.000000', NULL, 0),
