(2491158, 245493, 53316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  I don''t mind that it''s not totally sharp because it helps it look more... real, for lack of a better word.  Maybe the background color could have been a bit different, to complement the green better, but I do like the choice of green as symbolic of growth.   A tighter crop may have helped some, to give the figure more emphasis.  Really great border in my opinion.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  I don''t mind that it''s not totally sharp because it helps it look more... real, for lack of a better word.  Maybe the background color could have been a bit different, to complement the green better, but I do like the choice of green as symbolic of growth.   A tighter crop may have helped some, to give the figure more emphasis.  Really great border in my opinion.', '2006-06-06 18:44:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2517255, 246022, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Love how the wated affects the saturation of the colours differently. Deep blue sky in the water, but the actual sky is lighter. Muted trees in the water, but rich and vivid colour in the actual trees. <br/>And the perfect smoothness of the water adds to the sharp detail of the dead wood.<br/>Very nice.</td>', 'Great photo. Love how the wated affects the saturation of the colours differently. Deep blue sky in the water, but the actual sky is lighter. Muted trees in the water, but rich and vivid colour in the actual trees. And the perfect smoothness of the water adds to the sharp detail of the dead wood.Very nice.', '2006-06-14 16:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2548671, 244172, 27605, '<td valign="top">Genuine.  Lovely.</td>', 'Genuine.  Lovely.', '2006-06-24 13:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2550760, 244400, 33481, '<td valign="top">Wow, I know I have to leave a critique of one of your photos because France tied Korea, but I actually want to leave a message for this one.  I think this is one of the most incredible landscape photos I have ever seen.  The location seems like it would be rather boring, but with color and post processing, you have made it extremely interesting.  The reflection of the mountains is perfect. I love the fact that grassy area is somewhat dark and the shadows of the rocks expresses their edginess perfectly.  Well, not much of a "critique" but wanted you to know that.</td>', 'Wow, I know I have to leave a critique of one of your photos because France tied Korea, but I actually want to leave a message for this one.  I think this is one of the most incredible landscape photos I have ever seen.  The location seems like it would be rather boring, but with color and post processing, you have made it extremely interesting.  The reflection of the mountains is perfect. I love the fact that grassy area is somewhat dark and the shadows of the rocks expresses their edginess perfectly.  Well, not much of a "critique" but wanted you to know that.', '2006-06-25 03:32:16.000000', NULL, 0),
